<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:12.400" end="00:00:14.500" style="s2">That one.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.500" end="00:00:16.000" style="s2">I want that one.</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.500" end="00:00:18.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Turn him around. Let us see what we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.000" end="00:00:18.600" style="s2">paying for.</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.995" end="00:00:23.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.800" end="00:00:26.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our final lot. No name, no papers,</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.600" end="00:00:26.300" style="s2">no cameras.</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.000" end="00:00:34.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bloodrose, you don&#39;t have enough trouble</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.900" end="00:00:35.900" style="s2">tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.200" end="00:00:37.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One sip.</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.900" end="00:00:39.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last time you told everyone exactly what</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.600" end="00:00:41.600" style="s2">you thought of them.</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.000" end="00:00:41.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They asked.</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.800" end="00:00:48.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not Jamie,</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.300" end="00:00:51.400" style="s2">but this is the address he was sent to.</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.500" end="00:00:51.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On your knees.</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.700" end="00:00:54.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Make me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.400" end="00:01:06.900" style="s2">I came to see the [music] auction, not</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.000" end="00:01:06.900" style="s2">your little performance.</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.500" end="00:01:11.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m at Pier [music] 9. The address in</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.700" end="00:01:12.800" style="s2">Jamie Call&#39;s missing person report.</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.300" end="00:01:14.900" style="s2">They&#39;re selling a man. He&#39;s chained up.</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.800" end="00:01:16.400" style="s2">Send police to the side entrance.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.900" end="00:01:19.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You always interrupt [music] like this?</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.400" end="00:01:21.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only when someone gets my attention.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.600" end="00:01:23.700" style="s2">Want it?</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.100" end="00:01:23.700" style="s2">Help me with it.</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.400" end="00:01:36.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He wasn&#39;t offering it to you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.400" end="00:01:37.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you want him, bid.</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.100" end="00:01:38.200" style="s2">500,000 [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.000" end="00:01:40.300" style="s2">to start.</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.200" end="00:01:43.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 800,000.</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.300" end="00:01:43.600" style="s2">1 million.</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.000" end="00:01:48.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take your hands off him.</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.100" end="00:01:50.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get in line.</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.000" end="00:01:50.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 2 million.</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.700" end="00:01:53.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vane,</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.000" end="00:01:54.700" style="s2">I didn&#39;t know you were joining us.</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.200" end="00:01:57.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 2.5 million.</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.700" end="00:01:58.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A vain vampire taking home a wolf. Does</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.000" end="00:01:59.292" style="s2">your father know what you like? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.400" end="00:02:02.192" style="s2">3</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.292" end="00:02:02.192" style="s2">let go of the chain.</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.092" end="00:02:13.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 3 million. Going once.</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.092" end="00:02:13.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He hasn&#39;t paid yet.</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.592" end="00:02:22.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go.</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.492" end="00:02:22.192" style="s2">Open your hand.</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.492" end="00:02:32.092" style="s2">Do you have a higher bid or are you</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.592" end="00:02:32.092" style="s2">letting them steal from your stage?</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.392" end="00:02:37.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sold. 3 million. Step away from the</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.592" end="00:02:37.192" style="s2">platform.</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.892" end="00:02:42.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anyone else?</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.371" end="00:02:50.692" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.192" end="00:02:50.692" style="s2">They&#39;re backing off. You can breathe.</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.292" end="00:02:53.592" style="s2">And you?</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.992" end="00:02:56.592" style="s2">I&#39;m getting [music] you out.</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.692" end="00:03:03.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Payment first. Back here.</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.992" end="00:03:03.492" style="s2">Unhook him.</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.992" end="00:03:12.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Payment clears, [music] then we release</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.492" end="00:03:16.392" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.792" end="00:03:16.392" style="s2">My personal account, not the foundation.</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.692" end="00:03:24.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have the receipt. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.692" end="00:03:24.892" style="s2">We&#39;re in the room behind the stage.</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.392" end="00:03:31.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve been paid. [music] Give me the</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.592" end="00:03:32.192" style="s2">controller.</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.092" end="00:03:34.692" style="s2">Your friend can put her phone on the</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.192" end="00:03:36.592" style="s2">table first.</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.692" end="00:03:39.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m speaking to the police.</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.592" end="00:03:39.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell them you&#39;ve made a mistake.</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.392" end="00:03:45.892" style="s2">That&#39;s not the way out. [music] He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.192" end="00:03:45.892" style="s2">coming with us.</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.392" end="00:03:50.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re blocking the doors. The injured</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.192" end="00:03:52.527" style="s2">man [music] is being moved toward the</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.192" end="00:03:54.547" style="s2">loading passage.</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.527" end="00:03:54.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.792" end="00:03:58.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t turn around.</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.492" end="00:04:07.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Step away, both of you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.294" end="00:04:07.994" style="s2">He&#39;s chained to the wall.</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.394" end="00:04:15.194" style="s2">You wanted a wolf.</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.994" end="00:04:17.394" style="s2">Now you&#39;re getting yourself killed over</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.194" end="00:04:17.394" style="s2">one.</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.694" end="00:04:21.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Turn it off.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.294" end="00:04:23.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Behind that door, they have a</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.194" end="00:04:23.494" style="s2">knife.</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.898" end="00:04:29.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.794" end="00:04:35.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s off. You can let go.</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.194" end="00:04:40.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Release. Drop the knife.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.294" end="00:04:43.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The host went through there.</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.594" end="00:04:43.694" style="s2">There&#39;s another vehicle [music] leaving.</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.394" end="00:04:49.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your hand.</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.894" end="00:04:51.994" style="s2">Later.</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.794" end="00:04:54.794" style="s2">Can you walk?</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.994" end="00:04:54.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we go slowly.</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.894" end="00:04:59.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay with us, Nora.</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.294" end="00:05:05.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The car is there.</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.094" end="00:05:07.594" style="s2">I can help</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.894" end="00:05:10.094" style="s2">or I can walk beside you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.594" end="00:05:10.094" style="s2">Beside me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.494" end="00:05:15.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re outside with the injured man.</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.093" end="00:05:16.594" style="s2">[music] Yes, that entrance.</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.194" end="00:05:18.894" style="s2">There was a van leaving through the rear</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.594" end="00:05:18.894" style="s2">gate.</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.394" end="00:05:24.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You paid them.</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.594" end="00:05:26.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.294" end="00:05:27.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you expect me [music] to do?</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.094" end="00:05:29.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get checked by a doctor.</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.894" end="00:05:31.894" style="s2">After that,</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.094" end="00:05:33.694" style="s2">we&#39;ll figure out what you need.</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.894" end="00:05:35.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not what I asked.</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.694" end="00:05:37.194" style="s2">I paid to get you out.</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.494" end="00:05:39.794" style="s2">You don&#39;t owe me anything.</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.194" end="00:05:40.794" style="s2">You keep the receipt. My lawyer does.</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.794" end="00:05:41.258" style="s2">So they can&#39;t pretend this didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.794" end="00:05:41.694" style="s2">happen.</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.258" end="00:05:43.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.694" end="00:05:44.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Officers are inside. No one else in the</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.494" end="00:05:47.094" style="s2">holding rooms.</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.894" end="00:05:48.294" style="s2">They&#39;re checking the vehicles.</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.094" end="00:05:50.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jamie?</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.294" end="00:05:52.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No Jamie. [music] Grey Haven Medical is</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.294" end="00:05:55.394" style="s2">expecting us. Their night team treats</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.394" end="00:05:55.394" style="s2">wolves and vampires.</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.094" end="00:06:00.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.394" end="00:06:01.894" style="s2">Can you get this off?</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.494" end="00:06:02.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Breathing first,</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.894" end="00:06:03.894" style="s2">then the collar.</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.594" end="00:06:04.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t turn [music] it on.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.894" end="00:06:05.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.994" end="00:06:06.795" style="s2">Can you tell</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.195" end="00:06:08.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; me your name?</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.795" end="00:06:10.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay where I can see you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.095" end="00:06:12.044" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here. The collar stops you shifting.</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.395" end="00:06:13.195" style="s2">It&#39;s slowing your recovery, too.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.044" end="00:06:15.695" style="s2">[music] Taking it off won&#39;t heal the</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.195" end="00:06:15.695" style="s2">injuries.</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.995" end="00:06:18.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re cold.</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.695" end="00:06:20.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re still holding it. [music] That</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.895" end="00:06:21.495" style="s2">smell when you came up to the stage.</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.995" end="00:06:22.395" style="s2">Blood rose.</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.495" end="00:06:25.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You noticed everything.</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.395" end="00:06:26.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not everything. I saw you first.</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.495" end="00:06:28.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re stable. [music] Rest and follow</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.795" end="00:06:30.695" style="s2">up tomorrow. If the headache gets worse,</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.795" end="00:06:31.895" style="s2">you vomit, get comet, get confused, or</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.695" end="00:06:33.695" style="s2">have trouble breathing, come straight</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.895" end="00:06:35.095" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.695" end="00:06:36.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My memory?</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.095" end="00:06:39.195" style="s2">We can&#39;t predict [music] it tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.695" end="00:06:39.195" style="s2">Don&#39;t force it.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.595" end="00:06:44.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re very close.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.495" end="00:06:46.195" style="s2">I didn&#39;t ask you to [music] move.</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.795" end="00:06:47.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that the drink talking? I&#39;d rather go</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.195" end="00:06:48.195" style="s2">the credit. You really want to give it</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.495" end="00:06:48.724" style="s2">all with you?</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.195" end="00:06:48.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.724" end="00:06:50.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.795" end="00:06:54.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is he? Someone who needs to sit</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.395" end="00:06:54.095" style="s2">down. How long you keeping him here?</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.195" end="00:06:59.395" style="s2">They checked [music] more than once. We</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.195" end="00:07:01.195" style="s2">don&#39;t know who might come looking for</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.395" end="00:07:02.995" style="s2">you. Nora&#39;s talking to the police. Help</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.195" end="00:07:03.995" style="s2">me find him close. Leave his pocket</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.995" end="00:07:05.695" style="s2">alone.</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.995" end="00:07:07.095" style="s2">My father adopted Julian. I got a</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.695" end="00:07:08.095" style="s2">brother. He thinks he got a full-time</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.095" end="00:07:09.029" style="s2">security job.</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.095" end="00:07:09.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He thinks I&#39;m dangerous.</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.029" end="00:07:10.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.095" end="00:07:11.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stop looking so pleased about it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.995" end="00:07:12.095" style="s2">What should I call you?</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.595" end="00:07:13.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ray.</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.095" end="00:07:15.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t remember it. I just like it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.295" end="00:07:16.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ray it is. Do I call you Mr. Vane?</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.195" end="00:07:17.544" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not in my kitchen.</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.495" end="00:07:19.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said I was the first thing you saw.</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.544" end="00:07:20.095" style="s2">[music] What about now?</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.095" end="00:07:22.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re still making it hard to look</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.095" end="00:07:22.895" style="s2">anywhere else.</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.095" end="00:07:26.895" style="s2">Do you always say that and walk away?</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.370" end="00:07:29.390" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.795" end="00:07:33.895" style="s2">Sleep, Ray.</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.295" end="00:07:35.230" style="s2">Ask me again tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.895" end="00:07:35.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told him one miss class wouldn&#39;t hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.230" end="00:07:36.895" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.795" end="00:07:38.495" style="s2">He needed the money.</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.895" end="00:07:39.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said he could miss class. You didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.495" end="00:07:40.995" style="s2">send him into that room.</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.595" end="00:07:42.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll keep the original messages with the</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.995" end="00:07:43.895" style="s2">report. We have the auction receipt.</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.435" end="00:07:45.795" style="s2">[music] This connects him to the</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.895" end="00:07:47.895" style="s2">address. Are you giving away his place?</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.795" end="00:07:48.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. He asked for an extension. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.895" end="00:07:52.695" style="s2">He planned to come back.</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.895" end="00:07:52.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m on my way. Tell him I won&#39;t be long.</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.295" end="00:07:56.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You could have left. The door&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.695" end="00:07:57.395" style="s2">open all day.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.395" end="00:07:58.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I noticed. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.395" end="00:08:01.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why are you still here?</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.995" end="00:08:01.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He said he&#39;d be back.</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.595" end="00:08:06.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elliot? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.995" end="00:08:08.397" style="s2">I &#39;m I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.795" end="00:08:09.997" style="s2">Can I come in?</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.397" end="00:08:10.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.997" end="00:08:12.097" style="s2">Sit.</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.600" end="00:08:12.597" style="s2">[music] Slowly. Did you get the dressing</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.097" end="00:08:13.597" style="s2">wet?</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.597" end="00:08:14.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.597" end="00:08:17.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was trying not to.</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.897" end="00:08:20.097" style="s2">Let me get your arm out first.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.897" end="00:08:21.197" style="s2">Not there. A little higher.</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.097" end="00:08:24.097" style="s2">Here?</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.197" end="00:08:24.097" style="s2">Yes, that&#39;s better.</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.497" end="00:08:27.797" style="s2">I can do the rest. I was getting you a</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.197" end="00:08:29.197" style="s2">towel. Right.</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.797" end="00:08:31.097" style="s2">You called me before you fell over.</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.197" end="00:08:33.097" style="s2">That&#39;s progress. You&#39;re enjoying this.</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.097" end="00:08:34.997" style="s2">Being useful? Occasionally. Telling me</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.097" end="00:08:36.197" style="s2">what to do.</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.997" end="00:08:39.497" style="s2">You can tell me to [music] leave. You</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.197" end="00:08:41.497" style="s2">can stay if you want to. I can do that.</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.497" end="00:08:43.297" style="s2">You do this for everyone you bring home?</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.497" end="00:08:45.397" style="s2">You think I do this all the time?</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.297" end="00:08:47.197" style="s2">Do you? Keep asking questions and you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.397" end="00:08:48.797" style="s2">miss your chance [music] to find out. Is</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.197" end="00:08:51.097" style="s2">that a warning? Take it however you</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.797" end="00:08:51.097" style="s2">like.</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.197" end="00:08:53.997" style="s2">Don&#39;t look like that. It was worth it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.997" end="00:08:55.897" style="s2">I&#39;d prefer to be funny without [music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.997" end="00:08:58.597" style="s2">hurting you than keep trying. I could</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.897" end="00:08:58.597" style="s2">use the practice.</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.597" end="00:09:03.397" style="s2">Your sleeve. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.897" end="00:09:05.897" style="s2">I can help with one thing. Apparently.</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.397" end="00:09:07.297" style="s2">No blood rose tonight? No.</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.897" end="00:09:08.797" style="s2">And you still stayed.</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.297" end="00:09:10.497" style="s2">You asked me to.</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.797" end="00:09:13.197" style="s2">I&#39;d [music] like to kiss you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.497" end="00:09:13.197" style="s2">Then kiss me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.397" end="00:09:16.697" style="s2">Still [music] blaming the blood rose? I</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.597" end="00:09:18.297" style="s2">haven&#39;t had a drop. You know that.</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.697" end="00:09:21.396" style="s2">You could have said that sooner. You</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.297" end="00:09:21.396" style="s2">could have asked. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.997" end="00:09:25.597" style="s2">I brought what [music] you asked for.</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.097" end="00:09:26.797" style="s2">Thanks. Leave them there. You could have</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.597" end="00:09:28.397" style="s2">called.</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.797" end="00:09:30.197" style="s2">I would have helped him. [music] He</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.397" end="00:09:31.597" style="s2">called me. You should have waited for</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.197" end="00:09:33.497" style="s2">clothes that fit.</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.597" end="00:09:34.897" style="s2">He said I could borrow this.</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.497" end="00:09:37.197" style="s2">I know what he said.</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.897" end="00:09:38.697" style="s2">You found everything. [music] Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.197" end="00:09:40.097" style="s2">Are you coming to dinner tomorrow? Not</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.697" end="00:09:41.897" style="s2">tomorrow. Let&#39;s make it another night.</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.097" end="00:09:43.597" style="s2">We always have Sunday. Julian, it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.897" end="00:09:46.297" style="s2">fine. [music] I&#39;ll let them know. You</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.597" end="00:09:47.897" style="s2">can keep that. I&#39;ll knock next time.</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.297" end="00:09:49.597" style="s2">Any regrets [music] about kissing you?</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.897" end="00:09:51.197" style="s2">No. You? Was that for me or to win the</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.597" end="00:09:53.697" style="s2">argument? Try another. Decide for</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.197" end="00:09:56.397" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.697" end="00:09:59.697" style="s2">I remember this. You today [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.397" end="00:09:59.697" style="s2">asking for that kiss. So do I.</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.536" end="00:10:08.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.198" end="00:10:18.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ray?</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.198" end="00:10:20.298" style="s2">I&#39;m coming in. That sound. Can you stop</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.898" end="00:10:23.098" style="s2">it?</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.298" end="00:10:25.198" style="s2">No glass? Plastic cup? [music] Good. You</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.098" end="00:10:26.398" style="s2">aren&#39;t wearing shoes. You scared me and</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.198" end="00:10:29.498" style="s2">you&#39;re worried about my feet. I can</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.398" end="00:10:29.498" style="s2">worry about two things.</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.098" end="00:10:32.798" style="s2">Anything gets worse, [music] we call the</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.298" end="00:10:33.898" style="s2">medical center.</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.798" end="00:10:37.598" style="s2">I thought I&#39;d open my eyes and you&#39;d be</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.898" end="00:10:37.598" style="s2">gone. Check again in the morning.</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.298" end="00:10:42.698" style="s2">Leave it. I&#39;ll [music] do it. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.498" end="00:10:44.398" style="s2">bread. I think we can risk it.</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.698" end="00:10:45.898" style="s2">You slept? [music] Eventually. You were</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.398" end="00:10:48.298" style="s2">grading papers. I let the students off</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.898" end="00:10:50.198" style="s2">easy. Adults. No grades. [music] Mostly</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.298" end="00:10:51.698" style="s2">asking if it&#39;s too late to start again.</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.198" end="00:10:53.042" style="s2">What do you tell them? Bring a notebook</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.698" end="00:10:55.062" style="s2">on Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.042" end="00:10:55.062" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.498" end="00:11:00.298" style="s2">You&#39;re still here.</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.598" end="00:11:01.598" style="s2">So are you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.298" end="00:11:02.867" style="s2">You haven&#39;t turned the page. It&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.598" end="00:11:04.798" style="s2">difficult page. You&#39;ve been looking</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.867" end="00:11:06.298" style="s2">[music] at me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.798" end="00:11:08.998" style="s2">You keep looking back.</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.298" end="00:11:08.998" style="s2">I like the view.</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.072" end="00:11:14.298" style="s2">[music] You said you&#39;d let me work. You</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.598" end="00:11:15.598" style="s2">closed the book.</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.298" end="00:11:17.498" style="s2">This is a terrible way to get anything</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.598" end="00:11:19.698" style="s2">done. [music] I can move. That wasn&#39;t a</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.498" end="00:11:21.207" style="s2">complaint.</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.698" end="00:11:22.298" style="s2">Your brother was right about one thing.</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.207" end="00:11:24.998" style="s2">[music] This should be interesting.</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.298" end="00:11:26.698" style="s2">People should knock.</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.998" end="00:11:28.498" style="s2">You&#39;re getting bold. You keep asking me</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.698" end="00:11:30.377" style="s2">to stay.</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.498" end="00:11:32.498" style="s2">No one to blame today. I&#39;m not looking</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.377" end="00:11:33.998" style="s2">[music] for one.</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.498" end="00:11:36.598" style="s2">Ready for that walk?</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.998" end="00:11:36.598" style="s2">One more minute.</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.198" end="00:11:39.698" style="s2">Mr. Pike wants to refund you. The sale</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.498" end="00:11:41.398" style="s2">wasn&#39;t authorized. [music] Then he can</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.698" end="00:11:42.998" style="s2">call my lawyer. The original receipt.</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.398" end="00:11:44.398" style="s2">Then you get every dollar back.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.998" end="00:11:46.298" style="s2">And if I say [music] no? You need</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.398" end="00:11:48.598" style="s2">supervision. There are things you don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.298" end="00:11:50.598" style="s2">remember.</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.598" end="00:11:51.998" style="s2">He said no.</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.598" end="00:11:53.698" style="s2">Your family could be practical about</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.998" end="00:11:56.098" style="s2">this. Leave the notice. Leave the</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.698" end="00:11:56.098" style="s2">building.</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.298" end="00:11:59.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re trying to recover the evidence</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.398" end="00:11:59.898" style="s2">as well as you. The police have this</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.698" end="00:12:00.798" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.898" end="00:12:02.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if there is something I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.798" end="00:12:03.798" style="s2">remember? Something I did?</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.298" end="00:12:04.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll find out. [music] He still doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.798" end="00:12:05.698" style="s2">get to take you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.398" end="00:12:06.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Set a passcode. My number in the medical</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.698" end="00:12:07.398" style="s2">centers are saved.</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.598" end="00:12:08.368" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do I owe you?</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.398" end="00:12:08.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The phone back when you get your own.</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.368" end="00:12:09.398" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.598" end="00:12:12.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Save my number, too.</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.398" end="00:12:13.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sure you can handle that part.</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.498" end="00:12:14.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elliot.</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.598" end="00:12:17.299" style="s2">Across the street. Don&#39;t turn all the</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.899" end="00:12:17.299" style="s2">way around.</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.099" end="00:12:20.599" style="s2">He wasn&#39;t taking a picture of me. He</p>
<p begin="00:12:19.299" end="00:12:22.299" style="s2">wanted my address.</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.599" end="00:12:24.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A contractor threatened you. I heard it</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.299" end="00:12:26.299" style="s2">from Nora. Why not you?</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.999" end="00:12:27.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was going to. We kept the notice. The</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.299" end="00:12:28.299" style="s2">police have the footage.</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.299" end="00:12:29.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the man in your apartment?</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.299" end="00:12:30.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He calls himself Ray. He&#39;s recovering</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.599" end="00:12:31.399" style="s2">from a head injury.</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.299" end="00:12:32.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That isn&#39;t a background check.</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.399" end="00:12:33.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.299" end="00:12:34.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You remember Daniel. You know what this</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.499" end="00:12:34.999" style="s2">family lost.</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.199" end="00:12:36.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember a man [music] who drove me to</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.999" end="00:12:37.899" style="s2">school. Not a reason to leave someone</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.199" end="00:12:38.599" style="s2">chained up. No family files, no access</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.899" end="00:12:39.699" style="s2">to our offices.</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.599" end="00:12:40.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He hasn&#39;t asked for either. Let someone</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.699" end="00:12:40.999" style="s2">else house him.</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.199" end="00:12:42.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He can choose [music] somewhere else.</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.999" end="00:12:44.999" style="s2">You don&#39;t choose it for him or me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.499" end="00:12:46.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call me when you learn more.</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.999" end="00:12:47.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Going somewhere? Nora mentioned medical</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.599" end="00:12:49.099" style="s2">housing. Do you want to go? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.899" end="00:12:50.699" style="s2">Someone photographed your door. Your</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.099" end="00:12:52.499" style="s2">father&#39;s asking questions. You heard</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.699" end="00:12:54.499" style="s2">him? Only you. I know what an argument</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.499" end="00:12:55.999" style="s2">sounds like. Then hear this. I like</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.499" end="00:12:58.599" style="s2">having you here.</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.999" end="00:12:59.458" style="s2">I thought I was being obvious.</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.599" end="00:12:59.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were.</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.458" end="00:13:02.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.899" end="00:13:02.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stop packing.</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.699" end="00:13:06.999" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.899" end="00:13:09.939" style="s2">Ray.</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.799" end="00:13:10.799" style="s2">Look at the room. You&#39;re here with me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.939" end="00:13:14.399" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.799" end="00:13:14.399" style="s2">There was a light right in front of it.</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.099" end="00:13:20.399" style="s2">I remember the water. Someone wanted me</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.899" end="00:13:22.699" style="s2">dead.</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.399" end="00:13:24.099" style="s2">Did you see someone? No face.</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.699" end="00:13:26.499" style="s2">A car came at me. I couldn&#39;t get the</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.099" end="00:13:28.099" style="s2">belt off. I was trying to reach</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.499" end="00:13:29.499" style="s2">It&#39;s gone again.</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.099" end="00:13:30.899" style="s2">That&#39;s enough for now. If I can just get</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.499" end="00:13:31.799" style="s2">it back. You&#39;re hurting yourself trying.</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.899" end="00:13:32.699" style="s2">[music] We can write down what you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.799" end="00:13:35.099" style="s2">got.</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.699" end="00:13:36.199" style="s2">You don&#39;t know that it comes back. No.</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.099" end="00:13:37.599" style="s2">I don&#39;t. I&#39;m not going to promise you</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.199" end="00:13:39.699" style="s2">that. [music] Everybody keeps saying to</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.599" end="00:13:41.199" style="s2">wait. I can stay while you hate waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.699" end="00:13:42.699" style="s2">Let&#39;s tell the doctor what happened.</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.199" end="00:13:43.899" style="s2">Then you can be angry at both of us.</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.699" end="00:13:44.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell me about the headache first. Is it</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.899" end="00:13:46.299" style="s2">sharper [music] than before? Any</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.899" end="00:13:48.199" style="s2">vomiting or new trouble seeing?</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.299" end="00:13:48.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. It eased when I sat down. I can see</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.199" end="00:13:50.099" style="s2">fine.</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.599" end="00:13:51.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. A fragment can return before</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.099" end="00:13:52.499" style="s2">the rest of a memory. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.099" end="00:13:52.999" style="s2">Trying to chase it doesn&#39;t necessarily</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.499" end="00:13:54.199" style="s2">help.</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.999" end="00:13:55.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So I should just forget it?</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.199" end="00:13:56.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Write down what you remember, not what</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.299" end="00:13:57.754" style="s2">you think must have happened. Bring it</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.599" end="00:13:57.899" style="s2">tomorrow. Rest tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.754" end="00:13:58.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.899" end="00:14:00.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if it happens again?</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.899" end="00:14:01.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If the headache gets worse or you get</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.099" end="00:14:02.399" style="s2">confused, vomit, or have trouble seeing,</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.499" end="00:14:02.994" style="s2">get urgent medical help.</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.399" end="00:14:03.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand.</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.994" end="00:14:05.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.299" end="00:14:07.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t put it down to a memory.</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.299" end="00:14:08.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It felt like it was happening now. I</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.099" end="00:14:08.899" style="s2">could hear you, but I was still in the</p>
<p begin="00:14:08.099" end="00:14:10.299" style="s2">car. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:08.899" end="00:14:12.099" style="s2">You looked at me when I said your name.</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.299" end="00:14:13.999" style="s2">It isn&#39;t my name. It&#39;s the one you asked</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.099" end="00:14:15.501" style="s2">me to use. What if the real one belongs</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.999" end="00:14:17.301" style="s2">to someone you don&#39;t like? Then you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.501" end="00:14:18.601" style="s2">tell me what I need to know. [music] And</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.301" end="00:14:20.901" style="s2">we&#39;ll have that conversation when we get</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.601" end="00:14:23.901" style="s2">there. You make that sound easy, too. I</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.901" end="00:14:23.901" style="s2">didn&#39;t say it would [music] be easy.</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.401" end="00:14:29.001" style="s2">What is it? I don&#39;t know, but I think</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.601" end="00:14:30.401" style="s2">I&#39;ve called it before.</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.001" end="00:14:32.301" style="s2">Hold [music] still. Your caller&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:14:30.401" end="00:14:34.901" style="s2">caught.</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.301" end="00:14:36.901" style="s2">All done? Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.901" end="00:14:37.801" style="s2">You don&#39;t look convinced.</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.901" end="00:14:39.701" style="s2">The doctor said the skin&#39;s [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.801" end="00:14:42.501" style="s2">healing. I&#39;d like your shirt to let it.</p>
<p begin="00:14:39.701" end="00:14:42.501" style="s2">That&#39;s not what I meant.</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.101" end="00:14:44.901" style="s2">I know.</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.901" end="00:14:46.501" style="s2">About last night, I didn&#39;t pull away</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.901" end="00:14:47.401" style="s2">because of you. I know that, too. You</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.501" end="00:14:48.601" style="s2">don&#39;t have to apologize for what</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.401" end="00:14:49.601" style="s2">happened. [music] I&#39;m not apologizing.</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.601" end="00:14:50.701" style="s2">I&#39;m trying to finish something I started</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.601" end="00:14:52.120" style="s2">saying. When you asked me to stay, I</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.701" end="00:14:53.501" style="s2">wanted to. I wasn&#39;t waiting for a safer</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.120" end="00:14:54.501" style="s2">[music] place or a better offer. Then</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.501" end="00:14:55.401" style="s2">why did you fold all those clothes?</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.501" end="00:14:56.401" style="s2">Because wanting something doesn&#39;t make</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.401" end="00:14:57.301" style="s2">it a good idea. You&#39;re asking the man</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.401" end="00:14:58.801" style="s2">who interrupted [music] an auction about</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.301" end="00:15:00.101" style="s2">good ideas? I&#39;m asking the man who</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.801" end="00:15:01.701" style="s2">hasn&#39;t slept properly since. I like</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.101" end="00:15:03.101" style="s2">kissing you, but I need to know you want</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.701" end="00:15:04.701" style="s2">more than a safe place to stay. I didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.101" end="00:15:06.001" style="s2">kiss you because you gave me a room. I</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.701" end="00:15:07.301" style="s2">kissed you because I wanted to. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.001" end="00:15:08.301" style="s2">That&#39;s your argument? It&#39;s one of them.</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.301" end="00:15:09.801" style="s2">What are the others? You look at me</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.301" end="00:15:11.121" style="s2">before you touch me. You argue with me</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.801" end="00:15:12.201" style="s2">instead of talking around me. And</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.121" end="00:15:15.101" style="s2">[music] when you laugh, I want to be the</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.201" end="00:15:16.701" style="s2">reason. Eat. Then we&#39;ll see.</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.101" end="00:15:18.401" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to call [music] tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.701" end="00:15:19.401" style="s2">I&#39;ve looked at it all day.</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.401" end="00:15:21.001" style="s2">I&#39;d rather hear it ring than keep</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.401" end="00:15:24.001" style="s2">imagining who might answer. Want me to</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.001" end="00:15:25.101" style="s2">stay for the first try?</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.001" end="00:15:26.301" style="s2">Maybe I got [music] a number wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.101" end="00:15:28.101" style="s2">Maybe they&#39;re busy. One missed call</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.301" end="00:15:29.201" style="s2">doesn&#39;t tell us much.</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.101" end="00:15:30.201" style="s2">I thought I&#39;d know what to say when I</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.201" end="00:15:32.501" style="s2">heard it [music] ringing. Start with</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.201" end="00:15:33.601" style="s2">hello. It&#39;s worked pretty well so far.</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.501" end="00:15:35.101" style="s2">And if they ask who I am, tell them</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.601" end="00:15:36.101" style="s2">you&#39;re trying to find out.</p>
<p begin="00:15:35.101" end="00:15:37.601" style="s2">I promised Jamie&#39;s sister I&#39;d [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.101" end="00:15:38.701" style="s2">call. I&#39;ll be inside. You can come in</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.601" end="00:15:41.501" style="s2">whenever you want.</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.701" end="00:15:43.801" style="s2">Elliot. I&#39;m glad I stayed.</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.501" end="00:15:44.601" style="s2">So am I.</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.801" end="00:15:46.701" style="s2">Hello?</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.601" end="00:15:47.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Say something else.</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.701" end="00:15:49.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I called this number. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.701" end="00:15:51.101" style="s2">I don&#39;t know why I remember it.</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.801" end="00:15:52.501" style="s2">Are you alone?</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.101" end="00:15:55.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is this?</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.501" end="00:15:56.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you, my king?</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.101" end="00:15:57.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have the wrong person. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:56.301" end="00:16:00.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell me to hang up. Say it the way</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.801" end="00:16:01.301" style="s2">you used to when I called during dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.401" end="00:16:02.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know you.</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.301" end="00:16:03.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My name is Finn Reed. You [music] gave</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.501" end="00:16:05.501" style="s2">me this number because you didn&#39;t trust</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.501" end="00:16:06.501" style="s2">the office lines. Are you hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.501" end="00:16:07.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone did something to my head. I</p>
<p begin="00:16:06.501" end="00:16:08.301" style="s2">remember calling you. [music] Nothing</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.701" end="00:16:09.401" style="s2">else.</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.301" end="00:16:10.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t give me an address yet. I&#39;ll send</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.401" end="00:16:12.501" style="s2">you a place you can check. We meet in</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.901" end="00:16:13.701" style="s2">daylight. You can bring someone.</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.501" end="00:16:15.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one else comes with you.</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.701" end="00:16:16.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Just me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.401" end="00:16:18.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He says we work together. I want to see</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.801" end="00:16:21.502" style="s2">him tomorrow. I&#39;ll have Nora check the</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.502" end="00:16:23.002" style="s2">place. Do you want me there? Nearby.</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.502" end="00:16:25.902" style="s2">Until I know if I recognize him. Then</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.002" end="00:16:26.702" style="s2">call me before you go anywhere else.</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.902" end="00:16:27.802" style="s2">We&#39;ve been looking everywhere [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.702" end="00:16:29.502" style="s2">for you.</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.802" end="00:16:30.702" style="s2">Your sister&#39;s birthday.</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.502" end="00:16:32.102" style="s2">What did you promise not to tell her?</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.702" end="00:16:33.302" style="s2">You dropped the cake.</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.102" end="00:16:35.202" style="s2">No, you bought the wrong [music] one.</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.302" end="00:16:36.402" style="s2">She hates cherries. We scraped them off</p>
<p begin="00:16:35.202" end="00:16:37.576" style="s2">in the parking lot.</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.402" end="00:16:39.402" style="s2">You said you&#39;d deny it if she found</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.576" end="00:16:40.802" style="s2">[music] out.</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.402" end="00:16:42.502" style="s2">Ronan.</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.802" end="00:16:44.002" style="s2">Nine months, a closed election, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.502" end="00:16:45.502" style="s2">no press portrait. You wanted the</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.002" end="00:16:47.302" style="s2">families at the border left alone, but</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.502" end="00:16:48.102" style="s2">the old delegates know my face. Vane was</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.302" end="00:16:48.702" style="s2">at the truce review.</p>
<p begin="00:16:48.102" end="00:16:49.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:16:48.702" end="00:16:50.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The bidders were from the southern</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.366" end="00:16:52.002" style="s2">[music] packs. They knew the title, not</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.502" end="00:16:52.902" style="s2">the man. The East Road, we were arguing</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.002" end="00:16:53.502" style="s2">about the missing drivers.</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.902" end="00:16:54.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.502" end="00:16:55.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I went to meet someone. I thought if I</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.602" end="00:16:57.202" style="s2">took an escort, they [music] wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.502" end="00:16:58.702" style="s2">show. Let me come. They can stay in the</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.202" end="00:17:00.602" style="s2">car if they&#39;re afraid of an audience.</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.702" end="00:17:03.302" style="s2">Give me 20 minutes. If I don&#39;t call, use</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.602" end="00:17:03.302" style="s2">the route I sent.</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.502" end="00:17:07.502" style="s2">That route wasn&#39;t public. Someone knew</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.202" end="00:17:08.361" style="s2">where I&#39;d be. We found the wreck, not</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.502" end="00:17:09.702" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.361" end="00:17:10.902" style="s2">[music] I kept a search team working</p>
<p begin="00:17:09.702" end="00:17:11.702" style="s2">after they told me to stop.</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.902" end="00:17:13.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who told you?</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.702" end="00:17:14.256" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The search office. I&#39;ll bring the</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.202" end="00:17:15.202" style="s2">original reports. I won&#39;t give you</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.256" end="00:17:17.102" style="s2">[music] a name until I can show you who</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.202" end="00:17:18.202" style="s2">actually signed. I remember who I am.</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.102" end="00:17:19.602" style="s2">What happened after the river is still</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.202" end="00:17:21.102" style="s2">missing. This property, it was part of</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.602" end="00:17:22.102" style="s2">the Vane portfolio. The ownership needs</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.102" end="00:17:23.502" style="s2">checking. It doesn&#39;t tell us who was</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.102" end="00:17:24.702" style="s2">using it. The car&#39;s ready. We can get</p>
<p begin="00:17:23.502" end="00:17:25.702" style="s2">you home, have our doctors see you, and</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.702" end="00:17:27.202" style="s2">tell [music] the council you&#39;re alive.</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.702" end="00:17:30.402" style="s2">Not yet. I&#39;m staying here. You were</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.202" end="00:17:33.202" style="s2">quiet on the way back this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.402" end="00:17:34.302" style="s2">There&#39;s a lot to take in.</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.202" end="00:17:35.202" style="s2">Did he know you?</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.302" end="00:17:36.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:17:35.202" end="00:17:39.102" style="s2">We worked together.</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.902" end="00:17:40.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And do you remember him?</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.102" end="00:17:42.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Some things, [music] an argument, a</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.702" end="00:17:42.902" style="s2">birthday still in pieces.</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.002" end="00:17:44.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about your name?</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.902" end="00:17:45.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He gave me a name.</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.402" end="00:17:46.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Any time before I can talk about all of</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.602" end="00:17:48.102" style="s2">it. You don&#39;t have to tell me everything</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.602" end="00:17:49.002" style="s2">tonight. But if there&#39;s someone waiting</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.102" end="00:17:50.102" style="s2">for you, [music] someone who needs to</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.002" end="00:17:52.202" style="s2">know you&#39;re safe, he&#39;ll tell the people</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.102" end="00:17:53.202" style="s2">who need to know I&#39;m alive. I&#39;m glad. I</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.202" end="00:17:54.402" style="s2">didn&#39;t want you thinking you had no one</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.202" end="00:17:55.702" style="s2">else. You thought I might leave with</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.402" end="00:17:57.202" style="s2">him. He recognized you. You looked</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.702" end="00:17:58.002" style="s2">different when he did. Different how?</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.202" end="00:17:59.502" style="s2">You stopped [music] looking at every</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.002" end="00:18:01.102" style="s2">door. For a minute, you looked like you</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.502" end="00:18:02.702" style="s2">knew where you belonged. I want to be</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.102" end="00:18:03.602" style="s2">here. Then be here. Don&#39;t look at me</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.702" end="00:18:04.802" style="s2">like you&#39;re waiting for permission to</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.602" end="00:18:05.802" style="s2">breathe. You shouldn&#39;t have to wait for</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.802" end="00:18:06.602" style="s2">me downstairs if I&#39;m teaching. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.802" end="00:18:07.802" style="s2">register you with the desk in the</p>
<p begin="00:18:06.602" end="00:18:09.802" style="s2">morning. Your brother left that. It&#39;s my</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.802" end="00:18:12.552" style="s2">spare key. What if you want it back?</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.802" end="00:18:14.102" style="s2">Then I &#39;ll ask, and you&#39;ll give it back.</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.552" end="00:18:16.302" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.102" end="00:18:18.902" style="s2">You make it very hard to go anywhere. I</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.302" end="00:18:21.102" style="s2">haven&#39;t even shown you the good coffee.</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.902" end="00:18:22.303" style="s2">Pull it tighter.</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.102" end="00:18:25.403" style="s2">Your fingers are already going pale.</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.303" end="00:18:27.203" style="s2">Hold this. I&#39;ll get another piece.</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.403" end="00:18:28.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You, tomorrow you carry the bags. No</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.203" end="00:18:29.582" style="s2">more staring at the gate.</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.203" end="00:18:29.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He can&#39;t lift anything with that hand.</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.582" end="00:18:32.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.603" end="00:18:32.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t asking him.</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.603" end="00:18:35.203" style="s2">What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.603" end="00:18:36.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trying to remember which van comes back.</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.203" end="00:18:38.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They all look the same. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.303" end="00:18:38.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not that one.</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.503" end="00:18:47.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One sugar?</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.403" end="00:18:47.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; None.</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.852" end="00:18:53.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.903" end="00:18:54.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He signed in. Would you like me to call</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.203" end="00:18:55.403" style="s2">upstairs?</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.403" end="00:18:58.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.403" end="00:18:58.603" style="s2">We&#39;re going out to the car for a minute.</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.403" end="00:19:01.803" style="s2">Everything the medical center asked</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.368" end="00:19:03.003" style="s2">[music] for.</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.803" end="00:19:04.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.003" end="00:19:04.953" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You could let someone drive you to your</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.003" end="00:19:05.803" style="s2">appointments.</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.953" end="00:19:08.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.803" end="00:19:08.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have a ride.</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.903" end="00:19:12.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two groups [music] want to suspend the</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.003" end="00:19:13.703" style="s2">joint deliveries. They think the</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.303" end="00:19:14.703" style="s2">disappearances mean the ceasefire is</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.703" end="00:19:15.403" style="s2">already over.</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.703" end="00:19:17.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who told [music] them that?</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.403" end="00:19:20.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody had to. Your chair&#39;s empty.</p>
<p begin="00:19:17.103" end="00:19:20.203" style="s2">People fill the silence.</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.503" end="00:19:24.603" style="s2">Medical cargo goes through. I have his</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.903" end="00:19:24.603" style="s2">authorization.</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.403" end="00:19:28.503" style="s2">Put the barrier aside. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.303" end="00:19:31.203" style="s2">If you want a vote, take it after the</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.503" end="00:19:32.303" style="s2">medicine arrives.</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.203" end="00:19:34.003" style="s2">Food and medicine keep [music] moving.</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.303" end="00:19:34.903" style="s2">Suspend the contractors we can&#39;t verify.</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.003" end="00:19:36.303" style="s2">The council will ask whether that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.903" end="00:19:38.103" style="s2">coming from you. The two delegates have</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.303" end="00:19:39.403" style="s2">my authorization. Keep it private until</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.103" end="00:19:41.203" style="s2">we know who leaked my route. They agreed</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.403" end="00:19:42.203" style="s2">to keep it quiet. Your family knows</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.203" end="00:19:43.603" style="s2">you&#39;re safe, too. [music] They still</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.203" end="00:19:45.503" style="s2">want to hear it from you. Arrange a call</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.603" end="00:19:46.703" style="s2">tonight. Just them. The Vanes own it.</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.503" end="00:19:47.528" style="s2">The tenant&#39;s name isn&#39;t on the public</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.703" end="00:19:49.003" style="s2">record. I&#39;ve requested the lease.</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.528" end="00:19:50.103" style="s2">[music] Check the facts before you name</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.003" end="00:19:52.103" style="s2">anyone. Does that include the man you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.103" end="00:19:53.503" style="s2">staying with? Especially him. That&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.103" end="00:19:54.733" style="s2">the same as excluding him. I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.503" end="00:19:55.603" style="s2">accusing him. I&#39;m asking whether you can</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.733" end="00:19:57.803" style="s2">[music] still hear an answer you don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.603" end="00:19:58.903" style="s2">want. He called a doctor, not a guard.</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.803" end="00:20:01.903" style="s2">He let me leave this morning. Those are</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.903" end="00:20:02.803" style="s2">facts, too. Then give him some of yours.</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.903" end="00:20:05.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet.</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.803" end="00:20:06.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does he know who you are?</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.003" end="00:20:07.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll tell him.</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.103" end="00:20:08.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You told me to bring the car. I can</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.503" end="00:20:10.703" style="s2">still take you home today. [music] Send</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.903" end="00:20:12.203" style="s2">me the verified records and let me know</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.703" end="00:20:13.303" style="s2">if anyone changes the search files.</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.203" end="00:20:14.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This was part of the follow-up on the</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.303" end="00:20:16.003" style="s2">man who photographed the building.</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.703" end="00:20:17.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Different car, different visitor. I</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.003" end="00:20:18.103" style="s2">haven&#39;t followed either of them.</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.203" end="00:20:19.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who came to see him?</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.103" end="00:20:20.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Signed as [music] F. Reed. Brought</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.303" end="00:20:22.003" style="s2">supplies. They sat in the car for about</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.703" end="00:20:23.503" style="s2">20 minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.003" end="00:20:23.905" style="s2">That&#39;s Gray Ridge Security. The company</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.503" end="00:20:25.305" style="s2">car doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.905" end="00:20:26.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; tell us what the meeting was about.</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.305" end="00:20:28.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.705" end="00:20:29.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why is a man who remembers so</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.005" end="00:20:29.905" style="s2">little [music] meeting someone like that</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.105" end="00:20:32.205" style="s2">in private?</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.905" end="00:20:33.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re starting with the first sentence.</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.205" end="00:20:34.305" style="s2">It doesn&#39;t have to explain your whole</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.205" end="00:20:35.805" style="s2">life. It just has to give someone a</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.305" end="00:20:37.205" style="s2">reason to keep reading.</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.805" end="00:20:37.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I left school. There&#39;s no way to make</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.205" end="00:20:38.505" style="s2">that sound good.</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.805" end="00:20:39.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have [music] to make it sound</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.505" end="00:20:41.505" style="s2">good. Tell me what you did after.</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.905" end="00:20:42.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Worked nights, looked after my dad.</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.505" end="00:20:43.505" style="s2">Things they don&#39;t put on application</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.505" end="00:20:44.905" style="s2">forms. [music] Those things kept you</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.505" end="00:20:46.405" style="s2">busy. They didn&#39;t make you disappear.</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.905" end="00:20:49.105" style="s2">You managed appointments, schedules, and</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.405" end="00:20:50.405" style="s2">money. Which one was hardest?</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.105" end="00:20:51.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Getting my dad to the hospital before my</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.405" end="00:20:53.205" style="s2">shift. If [music] the bus was late,</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.705" end="00:20:54.105" style="s2">everything fell apart.</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.205" end="00:20:55.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what did you do?</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.105" end="00:20:57.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Found another route, asked my neighbor,</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.605" end="00:20:59.005" style="s2">started leaving earlier. That&#39;s where we</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.105" end="00:21:00.005" style="s2">start. What you did, not an apology for</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.005" end="00:21:01.005" style="s2">being here.</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.005" end="00:21:02.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve read the incident report. The</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.005" end="00:21:02.705" style="s2">committee needs to know whether anyone</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.005" end="00:21:03.805" style="s2">connected to the case</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.705" end="00:21:04.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Visitors sign in. Staff have the</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.805" end="00:21:05.805" style="s2">photographs. The police cleared us to</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.905" end="00:21:06.305" style="s2">circle The evening exit will be</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.805" end="00:21:06.905" style="s2">supervised.</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.305" end="00:21:08.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; the man in the back?</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.905" end="00:21:09.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A guest I signed [music] in. He doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.105" end="00:21:10.105" style="s2">have access to student files.</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.105" end="00:21:10.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; need the rules to apply even when you</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.105" end="00:21:10.905" style="s2">like someone.</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.605" end="00:21:12.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They do.</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.905" end="00:21:13.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then send the committee the plan. We can</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.005" end="00:21:15.405" style="s2">fund a safer exit arrangement. We can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.605" end="00:21:16.105" style="s2">fund a promise that nothing will happen.</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.405" end="00:21:17.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You knew what he was trying [music] to</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.105" end="00:21:18.405" style="s2">say before he did. I&#39;ve heard that</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.605" end="00:21:19.805" style="s2">apology before.</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.405" end="00:21:20.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From your students? From people who</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.805" end="00:21:22.105" style="s2">think everyone else got a set of</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.905" end="00:21:23.105" style="s2">instructions they missed? You make</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.105" end="00:21:25.005" style="s2">people feel like they still have a</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.105" end="00:21:26.505" style="s2">chance. Sometimes they just need someone</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.005" end="00:21:27.705" style="s2">to read the first draft. Is that what</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.505" end="00:21:28.705" style="s2">you&#39;re doing with me?</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.705" end="00:21:30.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.705" end="00:21:33.005" style="s2">You&#39;re much worse for my judgment.</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.605" end="00:21:33.705" style="s2">Did you hate sitting through that?</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.005" end="00:21:35.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I liked watching you do [music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.705" end="00:21:36.505" style="s2">something you love.</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.305" end="00:21:39.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When you remember everything, will you</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.505" end="00:21:39.605" style="s2">remember this place, too?</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.805" end="00:21:42.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There are signs people were held here.</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.605" end="00:21:44.105" style="s2">Bedding, food packaging, restraints.</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.809" end="00:21:45.405" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.105" end="00:21:46.205" style="s2">No one inside now.</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.405" end="00:21:47.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How recently?</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.205" end="00:21:49.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re working on that.</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.205" end="00:21:49.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t give you a time I can&#39;t support.</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.505" end="00:21:51.105" style="s2">Can I look</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.905" end="00:21:51.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have left something I recognize.</p>
<p begin="00:21:51.105" end="00:21:53.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give them the photograph and the</p>
<p begin="00:21:51.905" end="00:21:53.305" style="s2">description. Let them finish the scene</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.105" end="00:21:54.105" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.305" end="00:21:55.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; her she had to go on. We have her</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.105" end="00:21:56.205" style="s2">statement. The contractor and vehicle</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.205" end="00:21:57.305" style="s2">records brought us here. We&#39;re following</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.205" end="00:21:58.405" style="s2">where those vehicles went next. Was the</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.305" end="00:21:59.505" style="s2">place was cleared before the address was</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.405" end="00:22:00.105" style="s2">requested [music] or after? If you can</p>
<p begin="00:21:59.505" end="00:22:01.105" style="s2">establish it.</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.105" end="00:22:03.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s one of the questions we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:22:01.105" end="00:22:04.305" style="s2">asking.</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.105" end="00:22:05.805" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to stay by the gate.</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.305" end="00:22:08.410" style="s2">They&#39;ll call if they need you.</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.805" end="00:22:08.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.505" end="00:22:12.805" style="s2">You noticed.</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.705" end="00:22:12.805" style="s2">You stopped making jokes.</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.305" end="00:22:17.705" style="s2">Send the confirmed vehicle records to</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.405" end="00:22:18.705" style="s2">Nora Quinn. Use your company name. Give</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.705" end="00:22:19.805" style="s2">her a number they offered</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.705" end="00:22:21.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And when she asked why we were looking</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.805" end="00:22:22.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Missing employees, that&#39;s true. It&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.105" end="00:22:23.705" style="s2">the whole truth. She doesn&#39;t need my</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.105" end="00:22:24.605" style="s2">name to follow a truck. Elliot does need</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.705" end="00:22:26.006" style="s2">it if you&#39;re going to keep coming back</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.605" end="00:22:27.306" style="s2">to his apartment. No speculation in the</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.006" end="00:22:28.306" style="s2">file, no names you can&#39;t support, just</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.306" end="00:22:29.606" style="s2">what helps them find the people. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.306" end="00:22:31.406" style="s2">I&#39;ll send it. The car is available</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.606" end="00:22:32.606" style="s2">whenever you&#39;re ready.</p>
<p begin="00:22:31.406" end="00:22:34.555" style="s2">I keep thinking I should have found him</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.606" end="00:22:35.706" style="s2">by now. You went to the police, you kept</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.555" end="00:22:39.206" style="s2">[music] his messages, you got them a</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.706" end="00:22:40.450" style="s2">place to search, and he wasn&#39;t there.</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.206" end="00:22:41.306" style="s2">He asked if he could leave class early.</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.450" end="00:22:43.606" style="s2">[music] I said he could make up the</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.306" end="00:22:44.706" style="s2">work. I didn&#39;t ask where the job was.</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.606" end="00:22:46.106" style="s2">Would you have known just from the</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.706" end="00:22:47.406" style="s2">address?</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.106" end="00:22:48.706" style="s2">Maybe not.</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.406" end="00:22:51.106" style="s2">You can&#39;t blame yourself for not knowing</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.706" end="00:22:52.806" style="s2">what they hid from you.</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.106" end="00:22:54.506" style="s2">His sister asked if he was cold. What</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.806" end="00:22:56.406" style="s2">did you say? That I didn&#39;t know. I hated</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.506" end="00:22:57.906" style="s2">how useless it sounded. You didn&#39;t lie</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.406" end="00:22:59.306" style="s2">to her. No.</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.906" end="00:23:01.006" style="s2">I didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.306" end="00:23:02.806" style="s2">Tell me something ordinary. I burned the</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.006" end="00:23:04.106" style="s2">toast this morning. I noticed. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.806" end="00:23:06.006" style="s2">You ate it. I thought you were trying</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.106" end="00:23:06.906" style="s2">something.</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.006" end="00:23:08.706" style="s2">Elliot,</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.906" end="00:23:10.606" style="s2">there&#39;s something I should tell you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.706" end="00:23:13.306" style="s2">In a minute. Just stay like this. Thank</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.606" end="00:23:13.306" style="s2">you for being here.</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.606" end="00:23:19.306" style="s2">How long was I out? [music] Long enough</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.806" end="00:23:20.406" style="s2">for dinner to get cold.</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.306" end="00:23:21.406" style="s2">You should have moved. You finally</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.406" end="00:23:23.106" style="s2">stopped holding your breath. I didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.406" end="00:23:24.106" style="s2">want to interrupt. Come outside for a</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.106" end="00:23:26.606" style="s2">minute. I need to stop [music] staring</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.106" end="00:23:26.606" style="s2">at that folder.</p>
<p begin="00:23:27.506" end="00:23:31.906" style="s2">You were going to tell me something.</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.231" end="00:23:33.206" style="s2">[music] The man I met,</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.906" end="00:23:33.906" style="s2">he can take me back to people who knew</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.206" end="00:23:36.306" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.906" end="00:23:37.806" style="s2">When? Whenever I ask.</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.306" end="00:23:39.306" style="s2">That&#39;s good.</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.806" end="00:23:40.706" style="s2">You don&#39;t sound pleased. I&#39;m trying not</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.306" end="00:23:42.306" style="s2">to [music] ask you to stay just for me.</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.706" end="00:23:44.006" style="s2">You can ask. Then answer me without</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.306" end="00:23:45.106" style="s2">worrying about what I want to hear.</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.006" end="00:23:47.306" style="s2">When you remember everything, will you</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.106" end="00:23:48.306" style="s2">leave? I want to [music] stay.</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.306" end="00:23:49.506" style="s2">For now.</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.306" end="00:23:51.206" style="s2">I can&#39;t promise never to have somewhere</p>
<p begin="00:23:49.506" end="00:23:52.706" style="s2">else to be. I wouldn&#39;t ask you to. I</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.206" end="00:23:54.206" style="s2">have work, I have a family. I expect you</p>
<p begin="00:23:52.706" end="00:23:55.206" style="s2">to have a life, too. And if the people I</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.206" end="00:23:56.306" style="s2">go back to don&#39;t like where I&#39;ve [music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.206" end="00:23:57.706" style="s2">been staying? Do they get a vote?</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.306" end="00:23:59.606" style="s2">They&#39;ll think they do. My father thinks</p>
<p begin="00:23:57.706" end="00:24:01.106" style="s2">he gets one, too. He doesn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.606" end="00:24:02.206" style="s2">It&#39;s easier to say that here. Then don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.106" end="00:24:03.506" style="s2">ask me to prove it to people you haven&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.206" end="00:24:04.406" style="s2">even introduced me to. Let me meet them</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.506" end="00:24:05.906" style="s2">first. [music] You might wish you</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.406" end="00:24:06.706" style="s2">hadn&#39;t. I might. I&#39;d still like to find</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.906" end="00:24:08.106" style="s2">out for myself. Then what are you</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.706" end="00:24:08.906" style="s2">asking?</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.106" end="00:24:10.006" style="s2">Whether this is somewhere you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.906" end="00:24:11.306" style="s2">recovering or somewhere you might come</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.006" end="00:24:13.306" style="s2">back to when you don&#39;t need me. When I</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.306" end="00:24:14.906" style="s2">come back, it&#39;ll be for you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.306" end="00:24:16.606" style="s2">You say that like it&#39;s easy.</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.906" end="00:24:17.906" style="s2">Wanting you is. Then when something</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.606" end="00:24:20.006" style="s2">changes, tell me [music] before I have</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.906" end="00:24:22.006" style="s2">to ask.</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.006" end="00:24:23.806" style="s2">I hear you. 5 minutes,</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.006" end="00:24:25.206" style="s2">then I&#39;ll go to my own room. [music] You</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.806" end="00:24:28.607" style="s2">said that in the kitchen. You&#39;re keeping</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.206" end="00:24:31.307" style="s2">records now? Only the things I like.</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.607" end="00:24:33.307" style="s2">Too close? Wrong side. Come here.</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.307" end="00:24:34.408" style="s2">If I fall asleep, wake me. Don&#39;t sit</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.307" end="00:24:36.107" style="s2">here hurting because you&#39;re trying to be</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.408" end="00:24:38.307" style="s2">nice. And miss you admitting you need</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.107" end="00:24:38.707" style="s2">sleep? You get one joke. Then you wake</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.307" end="00:24:41.107" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.707" end="00:24:41.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.707" end="00:24:49.408" style="s2">I&#39;m looking for the office that [music]</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.707" end="00:24:49.908" style="s2">handles this address, not access to the</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.408" end="00:24:51.207" style="s2">building.</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.908" end="00:24:52.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The title belongs to a Vane property</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.207" end="00:24:53.107" style="s2">company. The management contact is</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.507" end="00:24:54.408" style="s2">listed separately. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.107" end="00:24:55.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Has that changed recently?</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.408" end="00:24:57.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can print the current listing and the</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.507" end="00:24:58.107" style="s2">date it was updated. The lease itself</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.007" end="00:24:59.507" style="s2">isn&#39;t available at this desk.</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.107" end="00:25:00.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough. Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.507" end="00:25:00.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you reporting [music] a problem at</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.507" end="00:25:02.607" style="s2">the site?</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.908" end="00:25:04.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not to this office. I need to know who</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.607" end="00:25:05.408" style="s2">answers questions about the building.</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.007" end="00:25:06.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then use the number on the listing. The</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.408" end="00:25:07.107" style="s2">owner and the people [music] working</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.207" end="00:25:08.307" style="s2">there may be different.</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.107" end="00:25:09.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood. Does the page say who was</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.307" end="00:25:10.807" style="s2">there last month?</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.107" end="00:25:13.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. It&#39;s a current contact, not a record</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.807" end="00:25:14.707" style="s2">of everyone who&#39;s used the premises.</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.408" end="00:25:15.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ray?</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.707" end="00:25:17.307" style="s2">I thought you were staying in this</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.507" end="00:25:18.908" style="s2">morning. I wanted to get out, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.307" end="00:25:20.007" style="s2">learn the area. You picked the one</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.908" end="00:25:21.107" style="s2">building where people come to argue</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.007" end="00:25:23.607" style="s2">about parking permits.</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.107" end="00:25:24.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The management contact is at the bottom.</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.607" end="00:25:26.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looking for someone? [music] Something</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.807" end="00:25:28.007" style="s2">from before. I wanted to see if an</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.007" end="00:25:29.408" style="s2">address looked familiar. Did it? Not the</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.007" end="00:25:30.408" style="s2">way I hoped. You could have asked me to</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.408" end="00:25:31.807" style="s2">come with you.</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.408" end="00:25:34.908" style="s2">You were working. I still know where the</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.807" end="00:25:34.908" style="s2">coffee is. Wait for me.</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.507" end="00:25:38.507" style="s2">People can see you.</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.307" end="00:25:39.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.507" end="00:25:42.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s usually what happens outside.</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.922" end="00:25:44.507" style="s2">[music] I mean with me.</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.408" end="00:25:46.507" style="s2">Am I supposed to be embarrassed?</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.507" end="00:25:48.107" style="s2">Your family already has questions.</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.507" end="00:25:49.408" style="s2">They&#39;ll survive lunch. They sent you</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.107" end="00:25:51.207" style="s2">away. [music] They need the insurance</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.408" end="00:25:52.607" style="s2">certificate. I brought last year&#39;s copy.</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.207" end="00:25:53.607" style="s2">You could probably make a call. I could</p>
<p begin="00:25:52.607" end="00:25:55.607" style="s2">also bring the right piece of paper on</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.607" end="00:25:56.507" style="s2">Monday. Does the name ever help? It gets</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.607" end="00:25:57.707" style="s2">calls [music] returned. Sometimes it</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.507" end="00:25:59.408" style="s2">also gets me rooms nobody asked me if I</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.707" end="00:26:00.408" style="s2">wanted. And this one, near the bus stop,</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.408" end="00:26:01.807" style="s2">students can get there after work.</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.408" end="00:26:03.607" style="s2">That&#39;s why I want it.</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.807" end="00:26:05.007" style="s2">Pick something you actually want. You</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.607" end="00:26:06.507" style="s2">don&#39;t have to order whatever I order. I</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.007" end="00:26:09.307" style="s2">know what I want.</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.507" end="00:26:09.307" style="s2">Something on the menu.</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.908" end="00:26:12.908" style="s2">Julian? Yes, I&#39;m at the harbor. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.807" end="00:26:14.507" style="s2">No, the application doesn&#39;t need</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.908" end="00:26:15.807" style="s2">father&#39;s signature. I&#39;ll be home later.</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.507" end="00:26:17.207" style="s2">You can bring the papers tomorrow. Call</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.807" end="00:26:18.007" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.207" end="00:26:21.107" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to disappear [music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.007" end="00:26:24.007" style="s2">every time someone calls me. Old habit.</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.107" end="00:26:24.007" style="s2">Then let&#39;s try a different one.</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.908" end="00:26:35.209" style="s2">You You a spot. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.609" end="00:26:36.908" style="s2">I noticed the bleeding. I meant the</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.209" end="00:26:37.709" style="s2">foam.</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.908" end="00:26:39.109" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.709" end="00:26:41.009" style="s2">Does everyone get this much attention</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.109" end="00:26:43.509" style="s2">for a bad shave? Only the ones who make</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.009" end="00:26:45.009" style="s2">me late. Late for what? Making dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.509" end="00:26:47.209" style="s2">You were going to help. I can still do</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.009" end="00:26:49.509" style="s2">that. Then stop looking at me like that.</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.209" end="00:26:49.509" style="s2">Like what?</p>
<p begin="00:26:50.309" end="00:26:54.509" style="s2">Like dinner&#39;s not happening.</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.209" end="00:26:55.409" style="s2">I could wait. Your pain meds need food.</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.509" end="00:26:57.909" style="s2">You&#39;re allowed to want something for</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.409" end="00:26:59.209" style="s2">yourself. I do. [music] Then ask. You</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.909" end="00:27:01.609" style="s2">don&#39;t always have to turn it into a joke</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.209" end="00:27:02.409" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.609" end="00:27:05.073" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.409" end="00:27:06.409" style="s2">Stay close.</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.073" end="00:27:07.709" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.409" end="00:27:10.209" style="s2">You should get that.</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.709" end="00:27:13.643" style="s2">You&#39;re still holding me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.209" end="00:27:13.643" style="s2">I noticed you didn&#39;t want to. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.509" end="00:27:17.209" style="s2">You don&#39;t look like the man I brought</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.609" end="00:27:19.009" style="s2">home anymore. Does that [music] bother</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.209" end="00:27:20.109" style="s2">you? No. I like seeing you get yourself</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.009" end="00:27:21.448" style="s2">back. What if there&#39;s something about</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.109" end="00:27:22.409" style="s2">him you don&#39;t like? There will be. You</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.448" end="00:27:24.409" style="s2">[music] already leave wet towels on</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.409" end="00:27:25.609" style="s2">chairs. I&#39;m serious. So am I. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.409" end="00:27:27.009" style="s2">expect to like everything. I expect to</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.609" end="00:27:28.309" style="s2">be able to tell you when I don&#39;t. And if</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.009" end="00:27:29.609" style="s2">it isn&#39;t something I can change, then</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.309" end="00:27:30.509" style="s2">tell me. [music] Stop making me guess</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.609" end="00:27:32.109" style="s2">which part of you I&#39;m supposed to be</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.509" end="00:27:33.209" style="s2">afraid of.</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.109" end="00:27:35.209" style="s2">I called.</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.209" end="00:27:36.609" style="s2">I heard. Come in. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.209" end="00:27:38.809" style="s2">These need your signature before Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.609" end="00:27:40.309" style="s2">I&#39;ve marked the pages. Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.809" end="00:27:41.609" style="s2">Have you eaten?</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.309" end="00:27:42.909" style="s2">I didn&#39;t know you had plans. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.609" end="00:27:45.309" style="s2">It&#39;s dinner, Julian. There are enough</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.909" end="00:27:45.309" style="s2">plates.</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.409" end="00:27:51.009" style="s2">No. I closed it before the crash.</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.614" end="00:27:52.809" style="s2">[music] The loading bay has no second</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.009" end="00:27:54.409" style="s2">exit. Use the north gate.</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.809" end="00:27:57.309" style="s2">I remember giving that order, Finn.</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.409" end="00:27:59.509" style="s2">Don&#39;t let them change it.</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.309" end="00:28:01.509" style="s2">I left the second envelope in the car.</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.509" end="00:28:04.009" style="s2">Ray can help me carry it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.509" end="00:28:05.509" style="s2">Nothing heavy. Dinner&#39;s nearly ready.</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.009" end="00:28:07.109" style="s2">There isn&#39;t a second envelope. You</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.509" end="00:28:09.509" style="s2">remember closing a gate. You remember</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.109" end="00:28:11.409" style="s2">why. That&#39;s a useful kind of amnesia.</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.509" end="00:28:13.709" style="s2">Keep your voice down. Why? In case he</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.409" end="00:28:15.409" style="s2">hears what you just said?</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.709" end="00:28:18.409" style="s2">I&#39;m not guessing from a message. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.409" end="00:28:20.509" style="s2">I heard you say it. I know.</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.409" end="00:28:22.009" style="s2">Reed was here on Wednesday. Company car,</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.509" end="00:28:23.009" style="s2">20 minutes with you inside it. How many</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.009" end="00:28:24.709" style="s2">people are taking [music] orders from</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.009" end="00:28:26.309" style="s2">you while Elliot brings you water? You</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.709" end="00:28:27.309" style="s2">had someone watching the building. There</p>
<p begin="00:28:26.309" end="00:28:29.009" style="s2">was a threat. I asked [music] for</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.309" end="00:28:30.309" style="s2">updates.</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.009" end="00:28:31.809" style="s2">Does Elliot know those updates include</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.309" end="00:28:33.309" style="s2">everyone who visits me? But every time</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.809" end="00:28:35.310" style="s2">since Tuesday.</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.309" end="00:28:36.310" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.310" end="00:28:37.210" style="s2">He keeps giving you room because he</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.310" end="00:28:38.510" style="s2">thinks you&#39;re scared of what you might</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.210" end="00:28:39.510" style="s2">remember. You let him do that.</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.510" end="00:28:40.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was scared of what would happen when I</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.510" end="00:28:40.910" style="s2">told him.</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.010" end="00:28:42.030" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You could have gone home, had the</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.910" end="00:28:43.310" style="s2">conversation from somewhere else. You</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.030" end="00:28:44.610" style="s2">[music] stayed in his bed. Don&#39;t invent</p>
<p begin="00:28:43.310" end="00:28:46.410" style="s2">things. We&#39;ve kissed. That&#39;s enough for</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.610" end="00:28:47.910" style="s2">you to be angry about. Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.410" end="00:28:48.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone with people to answer to. What</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.910" end="00:28:49.210" style="s2">happened to me involves [music] them</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.910" end="00:28:50.110" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.210" end="00:28:52.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That isn&#39;t a name.</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.110" end="00:28:54.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, it isn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.710" end="00:28:55.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then pack. Whatever this is, you&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.310" end="00:28:57.010" style="s2">using my brother&#39;s apartment to do it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.510" end="00:28:58.310" style="s2">You don&#39;t decide whether I stay there.</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.010" end="00:29:00.410" style="s2">Neither does he, apparently. Not when</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.310" end="00:29:01.510" style="s2">you hide what he&#39;d need to decide.</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.410" end="00:29:02.710" style="s2">Tell him or I will.</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.510" end="00:29:03.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will tell him.</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.710" end="00:29:05.110" style="s2">But not [music] with you standing behind</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.810" end="00:29:06.210" style="s2">him waiting to turn it into a reason he</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.110" end="00:29:07.610" style="s2">can&#39;t choose anyone else.</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.210" end="00:29:08.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t get to talk about us.</p>
<p begin="00:29:07.610" end="00:29:09.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why do you look at him [music] like</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.510" end="00:29:12.310" style="s2">that? Are you afraid I&#39;ll hurt him or</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.910" end="00:29:13.710" style="s2">afraid he&#39;ll choose me?</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.310" end="00:29:14.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been there for years. You walked in</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.710" end="00:29:15.710" style="s2">last week.</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.910" end="00:29:17.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And that gives you the right [music] to</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.710" end="00:29:18.110" style="s2">choose for him?</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.010" end="00:29:19.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t get to lecture me about</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.110" end="00:29:21.310" style="s2">choices.</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.910" end="00:29:22.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right. Let&#39;s go upstairs. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.310" end="00:29:24.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you going to tell him?</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.510" end="00:29:25.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What I remember.</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.110" end="00:29:26.310" style="s2">When it came back.</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.710" end="00:29:27.910" style="s2">All of it.</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.310" end="00:29:28.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Security has the entrance. Police are on</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.910" end="00:29:29.510" style="s2">their way.</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.110" end="00:29:31.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send it to Elliot too, directly. This</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.510" end="00:29:32.910" style="s2">doesn&#39;t wait until the car leaves.</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.710" end="00:29:34.110" style="s2">Where&#39;s the other envelope?</p>
<p begin="00:29:32.910" end="00:29:35.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There wasn&#39;t [music] one. I wanted him</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.110" end="00:29:36.010" style="s2">alone.</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.010" end="00:29:36.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you couldn&#39;t say that in front of</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.010" end="00:29:38.510" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.510" end="00:29:39.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He heard me giving orders about work I</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.510" end="00:29:41.620" style="s2">said I couldn&#39;t remember.</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.810" end="00:29:43.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much came back? My name, my family,</p>
<p begin="00:29:41.620" end="00:29:45.710" style="s2">[music] my job. When?</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.510" end="00:29:48.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tuesday. At the cafe while you were</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.710" end="00:29:50.310" style="s2">outside waiting for me.</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.210" end="00:29:51.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before I gave you the key?</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.310" end="00:29:53.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.710" end="00:29:54.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before I asked if you&#39;d leave when you</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.010" end="00:29:55.210" style="s2">remembered?</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.310" end="00:29:56.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.210" end="00:29:58.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You watched me worry about losing you to</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.610" end="00:30:00.010" style="s2">a [music] life you already had back.</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.110" end="00:30:02.310" style="s2">Ronan Ash, I lead Grey Ridge. I&#39;m the</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.010" end="00:30:03.410" style="s2">Wolf King.</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.310" end="00:30:04.545" style="s2">You told me you&#39;d remembered. You never</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.410" end="00:30:04.810" style="s2">said you knew about Tuesday.</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.545" end="00:30:06.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.810" end="00:30:06.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tonight, downstairs, I told him to tell</p>
<p begin="00:30:06.410" end="00:30:07.810" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:30:06.810" end="00:30:08.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ash,</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.810" end="00:30:09.710" style="s2">we sat across from each other at the</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.910" end="00:30:10.910" style="s2">Truth Review.</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.710" end="00:30:11.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s what I needed to know. I&#39;ll call</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.910" end="00:30:11.810" style="s2">you later.</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.410" end="00:30:12.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elliot, don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.810" end="00:30:14.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before the crash, I was looking for</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.910" end="00:30:15.610" style="s2">missing drivers. A freight list led to</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.510" end="00:30:17.010" style="s2">your family&#39;s property. When I</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.610" end="00:30:18.510" style="s2">remembered, I kept looking for my</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.010" end="00:30:20.110" style="s2">apartment.</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.510" end="00:30:21.310" style="s2">Yes, public records, Finn&#39;s files. I</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.110" end="00:30:22.910" style="s2">didn&#39;t open yours. I still used your</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.310" end="00:30:24.310" style="s2">trust. And the truck records Nora got, I</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.910" end="00:30:25.410" style="s2">sent them through Finn. After the empty</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.310" end="00:30:27.310" style="s2">yard search, I asked him to leave my</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.410" end="00:30:28.110" style="s2">name out. The first time you kissed me,</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.310" end="00:30:29.410" style="s2">did you know then?</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.110" end="00:30:30.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I wanted you before I knew anything</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.410" end="00:30:32.310" style="s2">else. And then you made sure I never got</p>
<p begin="00:30:30.710" end="00:30:34.110" style="s2">to choose with my eyes open.</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.310" end="00:30:35.610" style="s2">I was afraid you&#39;d send me away.</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.110" end="00:30:37.412" style="s2">I I have asked you to stay. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.610" end="00:30:38.412" style="s2">You&#39;ll never know now.</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.412" end="00:30:41.612" style="s2">Pack what you need tonight. Finn can</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.412" end="00:30:42.712" style="s2">collect the rest through Nora.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.612" end="00:30:44.112" style="s2">The complete record list will be with</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.712" end="00:30:45.512" style="s2">Nora in the morning, including what I</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.112" end="00:30:47.612" style="s2">hid.</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.512" end="00:30:49.012" style="s2">for the case. This is my home.</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.612" end="00:30:51.512" style="s2">Good night, Elliot.</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.012" end="00:30:51.512" style="s2">Good night, Ronan.</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.112" end="00:30:55.512" style="s2">Father wants to come [music] home</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.812" end="00:30:56.912" style="s2">tonight. He can call. I don&#39;t need</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.512" end="00:30:58.612" style="s2">another person arriving to tell me what</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.912" end="00:31:00.312" style="s2">I should have known. Daniel taught me to</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.612" end="00:31:01.512" style="s2">drive eight years and father still</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.312" end="00:31:02.512" style="s2">remembers him as a reason to hate</p>
<p begin="00:31:01.512" end="00:31:04.812" style="s2">wolves.</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.512" end="00:31:08.212" style="s2">And now? Now I&#39;m angry at one man. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.812" end="00:31:09.912" style="s2">not handing father a whole species.</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.212" end="00:31:11.512" style="s2">Hey, it&#39;s me. I&#39;m okay. The job ran</p>
<p begin="00:31:09.912" end="00:31:13.212" style="s2">longer. [music] Don&#39;t send anyone. Tell</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.512" end="00:31:14.812" style="s2">Mr. Vane I remember his poem. Keep a</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.212" end="00:31:17.212" style="s2">light beside the door. If I call, don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.812" end="00:31:17.212" style="s2">look for me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.612" end="00:31:23.212" style="s2">He wrote it. He changed one word because</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.412" end="00:31:24.212" style="s2">someone was listening. Play the end.</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.212" end="00:31:25.612" style="s2">I&#39;ve heard pumps like that near the</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.212" end="00:31:26.112" style="s2">docks. More than one site. Send the</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.612" end="00:31:27.212" style="s2">whole file.</p>
<p begin="00:31:26.112" end="00:31:28.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The detective [music] has it and your</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.212" end="00:31:29.712" style="s2">records arrived this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.412" end="00:31:31.661" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll wait outside. Call if you need the</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.712" end="00:31:35.012" style="s2">route list. Stay at the table. I need</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.661" end="00:31:35.012" style="s2">[music] you to work, not disappear.</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.112" end="00:31:38.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move him up. This room&#39;s done.</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.612" end="00:31:42.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He needs his bandages.</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.912" end="00:31:49.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You told me he was dead.</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.312" end="00:31:50.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The river took [music] the car. We found</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.512" end="00:31:51.412" style="s2">nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.312" end="00:31:53.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at your phone.</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.412" end="00:31:54.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ash, why hasn&#39;t he called the council?</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.312" end="00:31:55.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because we&#39;ve been looking at a dead</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.312" end="00:31:57.512" style="s2">man&#39;s name instead of a living man&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.712" end="00:31:58.812" style="s2">face. The auction papers had no name. My</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.512" end="00:32:00.312" style="s2">southern buyers didn&#39;t know him. You</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.812" end="00:32:01.792" style="s2">should have checked.</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.312" end="00:32:02.812" style="s2">Get Derek. I need to know what Ash</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.792" end="00:32:03.512" style="s2">[music] remembers before he puts it on</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.812" end="00:32:05.612" style="s2">record.</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.512" end="00:32:07.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No missing pages. Nora checked. You can</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.612" end="00:32:09.012" style="s2">ask Finn anything. I did. He says you</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.512" end="00:32:10.212" style="s2">run a company as well as a kingdom.</p>
<p begin="00:32:09.012" end="00:32:11.912" style="s2">Apparently I had the only unemployed</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.212" end="00:32:13.612" style="s2">version of you. I like that version too</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.912" end="00:32:14.712" style="s2">much. Dinner tonight, somewhere I can</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.612" end="00:32:16.212" style="s2">leave when I want. [music] A date, a</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.712" end="00:32:17.712" style="s2">conversation you don&#39;t get to postpone.</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.212" end="00:32:20.112" style="s2">Don&#39;t dress it up.</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.712" end="00:32:20.112" style="s2">I&#39;ll be there.</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.412" end="00:32:25.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No shots in the restaurant. Get him in</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.312" end="00:32:27.012" style="s2">the garage. And Vane, he can watch if he</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.212" end="00:32:28.712" style="s2">stays out of the way.</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.012" end="00:32:30.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your ribs didn&#39;t lie to me.</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.712" end="00:32:32.312" style="s2">You can sit.</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.912" end="00:32:33.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I ordered water. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.312" end="00:32:35.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.212" end="00:32:36.612" style="s2">No blood rose to blame. Don&#39;t I can</p>
<p begin="00:32:35.212" end="00:32:37.832" style="s2">choose dinner. I know.</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.612" end="00:32:39.213" style="s2">Were any of those mornings real? The</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.832" end="00:32:40.413" style="s2">[music] burnt toast, waiting for you to</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.213" end="00:32:42.313" style="s2">wake up, wanting another minute before</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.413" end="00:32:43.213" style="s2">you went to class, all real?</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.313" end="00:32:44.613" style="s2">Then why did I have to find the lie</p>
<p begin="00:32:43.213" end="00:32:45.613" style="s2">inside every one of them? Because I put</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.613" end="00:32:46.987" style="s2">it there.</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.613" end="00:32:49.713" style="s2">I wanted you to argue. I&#39;d rather you</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.987" end="00:32:51.313" style="s2">[music] heard me for once.</p>
<p begin="00:32:49.713" end="00:32:54.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know what dinner changes.</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.313" end="00:32:54.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You ate. I&#39;ll take that. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.213" end="00:33:00.513" style="s2">Who called you?</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.313" end="00:33:02.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want to change your life? Behind you,</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.513" end="00:33:05.613" style="s2">PILLAR. ELLIOT, NOW!</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.813" end="00:33:08.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I HAVE HIM. GET BACK. DEREK,</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.613" end="00:33:08.813" style="s2">YOU pulled me off that boat.</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.813" end="00:33:16.013" style="s2">It&#39;s a cut. The ribs. Let the medic</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.013" end="00:33:16.013" style="s2">finish that sentence.</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.913" end="00:33:19.813" style="s2">You&#39;re bleeding, too. Mine can wait 30</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.313" end="00:33:21.813" style="s2">seconds. [music] I remembered Derek just</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.813" end="00:33:23.213" style="s2">now. His voice, the ring. I&#39;ll tell the</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.813" end="00:33:24.913" style="s2">detective exactly that. No guessing to</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.213" end="00:33:26.313" style="s2">fill the rest. No.</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.913" end="00:33:28.013" style="s2">Father says you can come to the house</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.313" end="00:33:29.413" style="s2">tonight. I have an apartment. An</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.013" end="00:33:30.913" style="s2">apartment they know. Then help Owen</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.413" end="00:33:32.413" style="s2">secure it. [music] Don&#39;t turn every</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.913" end="00:33:33.113" style="s2">threat into a reason I have to move</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.413" end="00:33:34.913" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.113" end="00:33:36.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No new fracture. The old one still needs</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.913" end="00:33:38.213" style="s2">rest. [music] Someone else carries your</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.413" end="00:33:39.913" style="s2">bags.</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.213" end="00:33:42.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just to the car.</p>
<p begin="00:33:39.913" end="00:33:42.313" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.813" end="00:33:46.813" style="s2">He&#39;s safe. [music] No, I didn&#39;t bring</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.013" end="00:33:46.813" style="s2">him home. He said no.</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.013" end="00:33:50.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you remember seeing, not what</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.113" end="00:33:52.813" style="s2">you&#39;ve learned since? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.813" end="00:33:53.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The boat floor, Derek&#39;s ring, his voice.</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.813" end="00:33:54.913" style="s2">The rest of that journey is still</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.813" end="00:33:55.713" style="s2">missing. And everything you sent Nora</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.913" end="00:33:58.013" style="s2">while you lived with me? This is the</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.713" end="00:33:58.913" style="s2">whole chain. Who sent it, when, and the</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.013" end="00:34:00.413" style="s2">attachment. [music] He asked me to</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.913" end="00:34:01.413" style="s2">remove his name from the cover email.</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.413" end="00:34:04.613" style="s2">That&#39;s corrected here. It stays</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.413" end="00:34:04.613" style="s2">corrected if my counsel hates it.</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.513" end="00:34:10.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t lose this job.</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.313" end="00:34:10.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to say it here.</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.313" end="00:34:14.113" style="s2">That van came back empty, but they still</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.413" end="00:34:15.713" style="s2">ordered food for 12.</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.113" end="00:34:17.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two donors pulled [music] out. Someone</p>
<p begin="00:34:15.713" end="00:34:17.713" style="s2">told them you brought the Wolf King into</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.013" end="00:34:19.313" style="s2">the school.</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.713" end="00:34:21.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He sat in the back row.</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.313" end="00:34:22.713" style="s2">The students never worked for him.</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.213" end="00:34:23.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. They want distance. [music] I</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.713" end="00:34:24.313" style="s2">need to know how we pay next month&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.913" end="00:34:25.713" style="s2">rent.</p>
<p begin="00:34:24.313" end="00:34:27.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll cover month month. After that, we</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.713" end="00:34:28.113" style="s2">need a budget we can count on. Cut my</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.013" end="00:34:29.713" style="s2">stipend, keep the transport fund. This</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.113" end="00:34:30.813" style="s2">is Ron and Ash. If your employer has a</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.713" end="00:34:32.213" style="s2">problem with me, he can call [music] me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.813" end="00:34:33.913" style="s2">The students aren&#39;t a message board. You</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.213" end="00:34:37.013" style="s2">can&#39;t order them to like me. No. But</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.913" end="00:34:37.013" style="s2">they can dislike me by name.</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.313" end="00:34:39.113" style="s2">Let him pay. He brought this to your</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.713" end="00:34:39.913" style="s2">door.</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.113" end="00:34:41.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then the school lives [music] on what</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.913" end="00:34:42.114" style="s2">happens between us. I&#39;m not doing that</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.313" end="00:34:43.214" style="s2">to the students.</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.114" end="00:34:43.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You always make this harder than it</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.214" end="00:34:45.414" style="s2">needs to be.</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.914" end="00:34:46.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You taught me not to sell what matters.</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.414" end="00:34:47.814" style="s2">I&#39;m trying it your way.</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.614" end="00:34:48.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have enough teachers. [music] We need</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.814" end="00:34:51.914" style="s2">a room.</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.114" end="00:34:51.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can stand under it. I&#39;m angry,</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.714" end="00:34:56.734" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.214" end="00:35:02.214" style="s2">not contagious. Daniel kept an umbrella</p>
<p begin="00:35:01.214" end="00:35:03.314" style="s2">in every car. I still [music] never</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.214" end="00:35:04.914" style="s2">bring one.</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.314" end="00:35:06.114" style="s2">What would he have said about me? That</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.914" end="00:35:07.514" style="s2">you&#39;re too tall to hide behind a cup of</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.114" end="00:35:09.014" style="s2">coffee.</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.514" end="00:35:10.114" style="s2">My brother&#39;s missing. You&#39;re sharing</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.014" end="00:35:11.314" style="s2">umbrellas with the people who own the</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.114" end="00:35:13.714" style="s2">warehouse. [music] Give me his name so</p>
<p begin="00:35:11.314" end="00:35:15.014" style="s2">you can put it in another folder.</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.714" end="00:35:16.314" style="s2">I&#39;m looking for someone, too. We can</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.014" end="00:35:17.814" style="s2">hate each other after we find them.</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.314" end="00:35:19.014" style="s2">North Gate. We tried asking [music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.814" end="00:35:20.414" style="s2">there. They laughed. Don&#39;t go back</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.014" end="00:35:22.614" style="s2">alone. Finn will take your statement</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.414" end="00:35:22.614" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.614" end="00:35:28.014" style="s2">They were here. The food was.</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.014" end="00:35:29.814" style="s2">We don&#39;t [music] know about Jamie yet.</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.014" end="00:35:32.314" style="s2">I hate that you&#39;re right.</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.814" end="00:35:32.314" style="s2">So do I.</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.614" end="00:35:35.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Crow&#39;s company used these numbers before</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.114" end="00:35:37.614" style="s2">the port changed hands. We need the old</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.914" end="00:35:38.814" style="s2">key.</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.614" end="00:35:40.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The old facility&#39;s [music] register.</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.814" end="00:35:40.914" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me it&#39;s lost. I&#39;ll come and</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.014" end="00:35:41.814" style="s2">look with you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.914" end="00:35:43.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who gave you these?</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.814" end="00:35:44.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A supplier helping the police. Jamie may</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.514" end="00:35:45.714" style="s2">have passed through one of them.</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.714" end="00:35:46.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ash sent you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.714" end="00:35:49.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.614" end="00:35:51.214" style="s2">I came because a boy is still missing.</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.114" end="00:35:53.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Crow&#39;s office asked for this last month</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.214" end="00:35:55.714" style="s2">for a maintenance audit.</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.814" end="00:35:57.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we send what remains [music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:55.714" end="00:35:57.714" style="s2">and tell the detective which page is</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.014" end="00:35:58.814" style="s2">gone.</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.714" end="00:36:00.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There are things in here about the</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.814" end="00:36:03.614" style="s2">border, about Daniel.</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.814" end="00:36:03.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then those go, too.</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.714" end="00:36:10.314" style="s2">Both reports leave out what happened. I</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.914" end="00:36:11.014" style="s2">was injured, sold, and taken out of that</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.314" end="00:36:11.614" style="s2">place by Elliot [music] Vance.</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.014" end="00:36:12.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; paid for you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.614" end="00:36:13.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He paid to stop them moving me. He</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.514" end="00:36:14.714" style="s2">called a doctor and gave the police</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.514" end="00:36:15.914" style="s2">evidence. He never claimed to own me.</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.714" end="00:36:16.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the warehouse belongs to his family.</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.914" end="00:36:17.114" style="s2">You can [music] see why people have</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.614" end="00:36:18.114" style="s2">questions.</p>
<p begin="00:36:17.114" end="00:36:18.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I checked the property and I lied to</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.114" end="00:36:19.614" style="s2">Elliot about doing it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.714" end="00:36:20.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were keeping us safe.</p>
<p begin="00:36:19.614" end="00:36:21.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That doesn&#39;t excuse lying to the person</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.614" end="00:36:23.214" style="s2">who helped me. He saved me. Don&#39;t turn</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.814" end="00:36:24.714" style="s2">that into an accusation.</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.214" end="00:36:25.114" style="s2">Did he ask you to make sure I watched</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.714" end="00:36:26.614" style="s2">it?</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.114" end="00:36:27.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. I thought you should know your name</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.614" end="00:36:28.814" style="s2">wasn&#39;t left undefended.</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.614" end="00:36:29.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m glad he said it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:28.814" end="00:36:30.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to call him because of</p>
<p begin="00:36:29.914" end="00:36:31.814" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.614" end="00:36:33.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.814" end="00:36:35.114" style="s2">I &#39;m not ready.</p>
<p begin="00:36:33.414" end="00:36:38.114" style="s2">He told us to wait for the search team.</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.114" end="00:36:38.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then he can catch up.</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.114" end="00:36:42.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our families are missing. Open the gate.</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.014" end="00:36:44.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s nobody in [music] that office.</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.114" end="00:36:45.016" style="s2">The police searched it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.814" end="00:36:47.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put it</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.016" end="00:36:50.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; down. You tell us to wait. Vane gets a</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.016" end="00:36:50.116" style="s2">guard and a locked door.</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.916" end="00:36:57.116" style="s2">Back [music] up, all of you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.616" end="00:37:01.116" style="s2">You could have stayed in the car.</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.316" end="00:37:02.716" style="s2">He had a weapon. You had a wall behind</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.116" end="00:37:05.316" style="s2">you. What am I supposed to tell Elliot?</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.716" end="00:37:05.316" style="s2">That you&#39;re safe.</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.516" end="00:37:09.416" style="s2">That&#39;s it? [music] You can mention the</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.616" end="00:37:09.416" style="s2">terrible parking.</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.516" end="00:37:12.316" style="s2">I&#39;m safe. He got between us. He didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.955" end="00:37:13.816" style="s2">[music] have to. That&#39;s Gareth&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.316" end="00:37:14.916" style="s2">signature. The records office confirmed</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.816" end="00:37:16.216" style="s2">the original. No recovered body is</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.916" end="00:37:17.716" style="s2">listed. Just the car and an assumption</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.216" end="00:37:18.916" style="s2">entered as a confirmed death. The river</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.716" end="00:37:20.516" style="s2">was high. The team couldn&#39;t keep [music]</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.916" end="00:37:21.616" style="s2">risking lives on a search with no sign</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.516" end="00:37:22.716" style="s2">of you. Then the report should say</p>
<p begin="00:37:21.616" end="00:37:24.516" style="s2">missing.</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.716" end="00:37:26.016" style="s2">Why did you sign confirmed? I relied on</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.516" end="00:37:27.116" style="s2">the field summary. Bring us the version</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.016" end="00:37:28.116" style="s2">you received. The one in this file</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.116" end="00:37:29.616" style="s2">doesn&#39;t confirm a death. [music] You</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.116" end="00:37:31.116" style="s2">think I wanted this? I know you signed</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.616" end="00:37:32.316" style="s2">it. The investigators can establish why.</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.116" end="00:37:33.516" style="s2">Until then, you don&#39;t handle these files</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.316" end="00:37:34.716" style="s2">or direct this inquiry. After everything</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.516" end="00:37:35.916" style="s2">I&#39;ve done for this council? Then you</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.716" end="00:37:38.316" style="s2">know better than to ask me to bury a</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.916" end="00:37:38.316" style="s2">report.</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.116" end="00:37:41.116" style="s2">Owen said you can manage the dressing</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.116" end="00:37:42.016" style="s2">yourself. I [music] can. I didn&#39;t ask</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.116" end="00:37:43.316" style="s2">you here to do it. Then say what you</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.016" end="00:37:44.216" style="s2">called about. I told Ray to pack before</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.316" end="00:37:45.416" style="s2">you knew he&#39;d remembered. I wanted him</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.216" end="00:37:46.616" style="s2">gone. I wanted you to come home and find</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.416" end="00:37:47.616" style="s2">the decision already made. You heard him</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.616" end="00:37:48.516" style="s2">lie and decided to take away another</p>
<p begin="00:37:47.616" end="00:37:50.016" style="s2">choice. [music] I had reasons to doubt</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.516" end="00:37:51.216" style="s2">him. That doesn&#39;t excuse what I did. Why</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.016" end="00:37:52.216" style="s2">tell me now? He helped me last night. He</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.216" end="00:37:53.416" style="s2">didn&#39;t ask me to say anything good about</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.216" end="00:37:54.516" style="s2">him. I kept waiting for the condition.</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.416" end="00:37:55.616" style="s2">There wasn&#39;t one.</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.516" end="00:37:57.316" style="s2">And you kept giving me conditions I</p>
<p begin="00:37:55.616" end="00:38:00.116" style="s2">didn&#39;t know were there.</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.316" end="00:38:01.816" style="s2">What else [music] haven&#39;t you told me?</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.116" end="00:38:03.216" style="s2">These came while I was checking on Ray.</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.816" end="00:38:04.316" style="s2">There&#39;s a patrol change I didn&#39;t send.</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.216" end="00:38:07.016" style="s2">It would show what else I&#39;d been looking</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.316" end="00:38:08.716" style="s2">at. Then send it with that explanation.</p>
<p begin="00:38:07.016" end="00:38:10.316" style="s2">Sent. The originals are at the security</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.716" end="00:38:12.316" style="s2">office. Tomorrow, [music] you help them</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.316" end="00:38:14.616" style="s2">get those too. Your men said they came</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.316" end="00:38:15.816" style="s2">for answers. I got six stitches. They&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.616" end="00:38:18.016" style="s2">answer for it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.816" end="00:38:21.116" style="s2">The repairs start now.</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.016" end="00:38:22.916" style="s2">You&#39;re putting your name on this?</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.116" end="00:38:26.216" style="s2">Your council won&#39;t like that.</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.916" end="00:38:26.216" style="s2">They can come help fix the door.</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.416" end="00:38:31.116" style="s2">Charger. [music] Side pocket. Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.716" end="00:38:35.116" style="s2">You don&#39;t have anything to say? I have a</p>
<p begin="00:38:31.116" end="00:38:36.016" style="s2">lot. You said tonight was for the boxes.</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.116" end="00:38:38.516" style="s2">Good night.</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.016" end="00:38:38.516" style="s2">Good night, Elliot.</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.716" end="00:38:42.516" style="s2">You taught me his [music] name. You told</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.916" end="00:38:44.216" style="s2">me who killed him. You never told me why</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.516" end="00:38:45.416" style="s2">the evacuation road was closed. There</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.216" end="00:38:46.717" style="s2">were threats against the convoy. Our</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.416" end="00:38:47.617" style="s2">guards held the gate. For how [music]</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.717" end="00:38:48.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; long?</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.617" end="00:38:49.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Long enough that people were trapped</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.617" end="00:38:50.517" style="s2">when the fighting started.</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.517" end="00:38:50.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you know that when the report was</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.517" end="00:38:51.417" style="s2">written?</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.917" end="00:38:52.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.417" end="00:38:53.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Their leader allowed the retaliation.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.317" end="00:38:54.417" style="s2">You civilians were still on that road.</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.317" end="00:38:56.017" style="s2">Don&#39;t let anyone erase that.</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.417" end="00:38:56.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t. Why did you erase our part?</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.017" end="00:38:57.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought admitting it would destroy</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.817" end="00:38:58.617" style="s2">what little peace we had left and it</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.817" end="00:38:59.617" style="s2">would destroy this family.</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.617" end="00:39:01.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You let me carry the hatred without</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.617" end="00:39:01.717" style="s2">letting me see what you were protecting.</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.017" end="00:39:02.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll give the originals to the</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.717" end="00:39:04.117" style="s2">independent review. The victims&#39; claims</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.917" end="00:39:05.117" style="s2">can be assessed against our assets. I</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.117" end="00:39:06.117" style="s2">won&#39;t ask you to defend this.</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.117" end="00:39:07.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Being my father kept managing these</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.117" end="00:39:08.317" style="s2">after</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.117" end="00:39:10.117" style="s2">The old codes lead to the pump station</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.317" end="00:39:11.617" style="s2">compound. I have the key.</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.117" end="00:39:13.117" style="s2">And the report my father kept out.</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.617" end="00:39:14.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want our old contracts. Your council</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.117" end="00:39:15.917" style="s2">wants assurances [music] and my son is</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.617" end="00:39:17.017" style="s2">somehow at the center of all of it.</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.917" end="00:39:18.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The contracts may help locate missing</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.017" end="00:39:19.317" style="s2">people. They should be provided whether</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.117" end="00:39:20.317" style="s2">Elliot speaks to me again or not. If I</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.317" end="00:39:21.717" style="s2">let this relationship continue, what</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.317" end="00:39:23.117" style="s2">does your council offer my family?</p>
<p begin="00:39:21.717" end="00:39:24.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your son&#39;s not a bargaining chip. If you</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.117" end="00:39:25.817" style="s2">want answers from me, ask. You speak as</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.517" end="00:39:27.417" style="s2">though you have nothing to gain.</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.817" end="00:39:28.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want him back, but I can&#39;t buy his</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.417" end="00:39:30.317" style="s2">answer from you. Neither of you has my</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.817" end="00:39:30.617" style="s2">answer, and father, it isn&#39;t yours to</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.317" end="00:39:31.517" style="s2">give.</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.617" end="00:39:32.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This agreement covers records</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.517" end="00:39:33.217" style="s2">preservation investigation. There is no</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.517" end="00:39:33.917" style="s2">promise to waive anyone&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.217" end="00:39:34.617" style="s2">responsibility. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.917" end="00:39:35.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Alliance will supply its</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.617" end="00:39:36.617" style="s2">corresponding records, including the</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.617" end="00:39:38.317" style="s2">prior leadership&#39;s orders.</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.617" end="00:39:42.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then make sure they receive both sets,</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.317" end="00:39:42.117" style="s2">not one story built from half the pages.</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.617" end="00:39:44.617" style="s2">You heard [music] what he said about</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.517" end="00:39:46.117" style="s2">wanting you back.</p>
<p begin="00:39:44.617" end="00:39:47.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard everything else, too.</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.117" end="00:39:49.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not telling you to forgive him.</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.917" end="00:39:51.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. [music] Signing this won&#39;t mean I</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.317" end="00:39:51.617" style="s2">have</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.717" end="00:39:55.617" style="s2">You collected your things. This one&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.052" end="00:39:57.817" style="s2">[music] yours from the auction. It was</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.617" end="00:39:59.117" style="s2">at the cleaners when we packed.</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.817" end="00:40:00.717" style="s2">You have 10 minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.117" end="00:40:02.217" style="s2">I knew who I was on Tuesday. I stayed</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.717" end="00:40:03.917" style="s2">partly to investigate and partly because</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.217" end="00:40:05.517" style="s2">I wanted to be near you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.917" end="00:40:07.317" style="s2">Every day I waited made it easier for me</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.517" end="00:40:08.717" style="s2">and harder for you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.317" end="00:40:09.917" style="s2">Yes. [music] I wanted to tell you and be</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.717" end="00:40:11.217" style="s2">sure you&#39;d let me stay. I kept waiting</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.917" end="00:40:12.717" style="s2">for a guarantee I had no right to ask</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.217" end="00:40:13.717" style="s2">for. I was afraid you&#39;d send me away. I</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.717" end="00:40:14.517" style="s2">made sure you had a reason to.</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.717" end="00:40:15.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What am I supposed to do with that?</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.517" end="00:40:16.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing for me. You should have heard it</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.417" end="00:40:17.017" style="s2">without having to ask the right question</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.517" end="00:40:18.017" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.017" end="00:40:18.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I miss you. That makes [music] this</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.017" end="00:40:20.317" style="s2">worse, not easier.</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.917" end="00:40:21.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I miss you, too. I won&#39;t use that to ask</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.317" end="00:40:22.917" style="s2">you to let me in.</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.917" end="00:40:23.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know if I can stop checking what</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.917" end="00:40:24.917" style="s2">you say.</p>
<p begin="00:40:23.717" end="00:40:26.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then don&#39;t promise me you will. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.917" end="00:40:27.217" style="s2">I&#39;ll answer when you ask, and I&#39;ll tell</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.317" end="00:40:29.217" style="s2">you things before you have to.</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.217" end="00:40:30.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s what I needed before. I know.</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.217" end="00:40:31.617" style="s2">You should go now.</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.017" end="00:40:32.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Good night, Elliot.</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.617" end="00:40:33.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nora has everything [music] I sent. Owen</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.817" end="00:40:35.217" style="s2">found the original patrol book. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.917" end="00:40:36.417" style="s2">helping him hand it over tomorrow. Then</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.217" end="00:40:37.017" style="s2">do that. What did you ask me to stay</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.417" end="00:40:38.317" style="s2">for?</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.017" end="00:40:39.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I kept telling myself I was protecting</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.317" end="00:40:41.517" style="s2">you. Sometimes I was.</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.917" end="00:40:42.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Julian, please let me finish before you</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.517" end="00:40:43.117" style="s2">tell me I am tired or upset.</p>
<p begin="00:40:42.517" end="00:40:44.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m listening.</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.117" end="00:40:45.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you see me as your brother. Being</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.117" end="00:40:46.417" style="s2">adopted doesn&#39;t change that, but</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.117" end="00:40:46.617" style="s2">somewhere after I grew up, it changed</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.417" end="00:40:47.717" style="s2">for me.</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.617" end="00:40:48.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How long have you been carrying this?</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.717" end="00:40:49.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Long enough to know it isn&#39;t because of</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.717" end="00:40:50.818" style="s2">him. He just</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.518" end="00:40:52.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; it impossible to keep pretending I was</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.818" end="00:40:53.618" style="s2">waiting for you to be safe. [music] I</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.018" end="00:40:54.818" style="s2">knew where you kept the spare key, what</p>
<p begin="00:40:53.618" end="00:40:56.218" style="s2">you forgot to eat, which call you&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.818" end="00:40:57.588" style="s2">answer at midnight. I thought all of</p>
<p begin="00:40:56.218" end="00:40:59.418" style="s2">that meant I&#39;d eventually be enough.</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.588" end="00:41:00.418" style="s2">[music] Enough for what?</p>
<p begin="00:40:59.418" end="00:41:01.718" style="s2">For you to look at me the way you looked</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.418" end="00:41:02.618" style="s2">at him.</p>
<p begin="00:41:01.718" end="00:41:04.138" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to be the person you call</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.618" end="00:41:05.918" style="s2">your brother. Not only that, I love</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.138" end="00:41:07.418" style="s2">[music] you, Elliot.</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.918" end="00:41:08.918" style="s2">If he hadn&#39;t come here, my answer would</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.418" end="00:41:09.918" style="s2">be the same.</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.918" end="00:41:11.618" style="s2">I love you as family. [music] That isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.918" end="00:41:12.518" style="s2">going to become something else.</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.618" end="00:41:13.718" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to say it like a sentence</p>
<p begin="00:41:12.518" end="00:41:14.718" style="s2">you practiced. I haven&#39;t. I just can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.718" end="00:41:15.818" style="s2">let you hear maybe for me because you</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.718" end="00:41:17.218" style="s2">hope they when I mean no. Are you</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.818" end="00:41:18.318" style="s2">disgusted with me? No. But you kept</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.218" end="00:41:19.118" style="s2">making choices to lead here. That has to</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.318" end="00:41:20.218" style="s2">stop. Then [music] we don&#39;t pretend</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.118" end="00:41:21.218" style="s2">tomorrow is normal. Take some space. You</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.218" end="00:41:23.518" style="s2">don&#39;t have to come to my apartment or</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.218" end="00:41:25.418" style="s2">manage my evenings. And when I miss you,</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.518" end="00:41:26.518" style="s2">I&#39;m still your family.</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.418" end="00:41:27.918" style="s2">But if coming to me keeps [music] you</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.518" end="00:41:29.518" style="s2">waiting for more, I can&#39;t be the person</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.918" end="00:41:31.118" style="s2">you turn to for this.</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.518" end="00:41:34.618" style="s2">Please go. I can&#39;t thank you for being</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.118" end="00:41:34.618" style="s2">clear yet. You don&#39;t have to.</p>
<p begin="00:41:38.618" end="00:41:42.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They told me it was for maintenance.</p>
<p begin="00:41:40.718" end="00:41:44.918" style="s2">No one fixed anything. Your log says you</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.918" end="00:41:46.118" style="s2">weren&#39;t sent back for two nights.</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.918" end="00:41:47.618" style="s2">I kept the book because they stopped</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.118" end="00:41:48.718" style="s2">paying me that week.</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.618" end="00:41:50.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The officer taking the statement is</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.718" end="00:41:53.118" style="s2">right there.</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.618" end="00:41:54.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep that too.</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.118" end="00:41:56.318" style="s2">We can&#39;t use this entrance tonight. The</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.718" end="00:41:56.818" style="s2">community center gave us six weeks rent</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.318" end="00:41:58.018" style="s2">free.</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.818" end="00:41:58.504" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I took two buses. Are you canceling</p>
<p begin="00:41:58.018" end="00:41:58.618" style="s2">again?</p>
<p begin="00:41:58.504" end="00:42:00.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:41:58.618" end="00:42:02.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. The class is moving. One stop and</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.718" end="00:42:03.744" style="s2">we&#39;ll get you there. Finn has two people</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.018" end="00:42:04.918" style="s2">outside. Let them carry the heavy ones.</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.744" end="00:42:06.918" style="s2">[music] Can they follow Celia&#39;s list</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.918" end="00:42:08.329" style="s2">without reporting to you first? Yes. And</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.918" end="00:42:09.618" style="s2">you can send them home if they don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:42:08.329" end="00:42:11.318" style="s2">[music] I won&#39;t be coming up to class</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.618" end="00:42:13.618" style="s2">back. I mean back to class. The work is</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.318" end="00:42:14.718" style="s2">fine. I get everything I need down here.</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.618" end="00:42:16.018" style="s2">You don&#39;t need to send anyone. When the</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.718" end="00:42:16.718" style="s2">horn When I hear from home, I&#39;ll answer</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.018" end="00:42:17.718" style="s2">if I can.</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.718" end="00:42:18.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He never [music] sounds like that. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.718" end="00:42:20.618" style="s2">reading what they gave him.</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.718" end="00:42:21.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Up, back, down here. We practiced</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.618" end="00:42:22.818" style="s2">directions when he started. [music] He</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.618" end="00:42:24.118" style="s2">used to stop and correct himself just</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.818" end="00:42:25.118" style="s2">like that.</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.118" end="00:42:26.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t get through three sentences</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.118" end="00:42:27.518" style="s2">without fixing them?</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.118" end="00:42:29.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wanted it to sound [music] right.</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.518" end="00:42:31.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Old numbers off, new ones on. Keep yours</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.318" end="00:42:31.918" style="s2">where I can see it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.318" end="00:42:35.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re moving [music] us apart. Look</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.718" end="00:42:37.418" style="s2">for me when the door&#39;s open. I&#39;ll look</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.018" end="00:42:37.418" style="s2">for you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.318" end="00:42:41.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I show you, [music] can they find out</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.518" end="00:42:42.818" style="s2">I showed you?</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.218" end="00:42:44.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t promise what they&#39;ll guess. We</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.818" end="00:42:46.618" style="s2">can call Nora before you decide.</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.618" end="00:42:48.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every white van looks like theirs now.</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.618" end="00:42:50.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to go [music] out alone.</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.718" end="00:42:51.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They called it an advance. Then I owed</p>
<p begin="00:42:50.318" end="00:42:52.220" style="s2">them for the ride, the bed, gloves.</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.559" end="00:42:54.120" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.220" end="00:42:55.720" style="s2">Jamie took my next shift.</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.120" end="00:42:57.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s keep what they sent you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:55.720" end="00:42:58.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If he calls while I&#39;m here,</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.920" end="00:43:00.120" style="s2">will I miss him?</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.920" end="00:43:02.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your phone stays [music] with you. We&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.120" end="00:43:02.820" style="s2">keep the ringer on.</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.820" end="00:43:09.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They took our names at the main gate.</p>
<p begin="00:43:06.920" end="00:43:10.220" style="s2">They put numbers on us after that.</p>
<p begin="00:43:09.120" end="00:43:13.220" style="s2">Who kept the list linking [music] the</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.220" end="00:43:13.220" style="s2">names to the numbers?</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.520" end="00:43:21.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out. The alarm&#39;s connected. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:43:18.420" end="00:43:21.920" style="s2">called emergency services.</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.520" end="00:43:27.620" style="s2">Was anyone else inside? [music] No</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.920" end="00:43:29.220" style="s2">classes. I checked the open rooms as I</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.620" end="00:43:30.220" style="s2">left. The firefighters are doing the</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.220" end="00:43:31.420" style="s2">full search.</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.220" end="00:43:32.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay with me. The papers aren&#39;t worth</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.420" end="00:43:34.320" style="s2">it. [music] Jamie&#39;s applications were in</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.720" end="00:43:35.420" style="s2">there. Nora has the case copies. We can</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.320" end="00:43:37.220" style="s2">replace the class files. We can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.420" end="00:43:39.820" style="s2">replace you. Stay here.</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.220" end="00:43:40.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m staying here.</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.820" end="00:43:42.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t know anyone was working here.</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.920" end="00:43:42.920" style="s2">Pike said it was empty.</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.120" end="00:43:44.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll make your statement at the</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.920" end="00:43:45.620" style="s2">station. Keep your hands where I can see</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.420" end="00:43:46.520" style="s2">them. They&#39;re moving the workers. Ask</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.620" end="00:43:48.120" style="s2">him about the trucks before they&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.520" end="00:43:49.820" style="s2">gone. They&#39;ve arrested someone. He says</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.120" end="00:43:51.320" style="s2">the workers are being moved. [music] He</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.820" end="00:43:52.920" style="s2">says the original move was scheduled for</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.320" end="00:43:54.320" style="s2">two nights from now. We found messages</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.920" end="00:43:55.620" style="s2">that support a transport job. The</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.320" end="00:43:56.620" style="s2">location is still being checked.</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.620" end="00:43:56.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Original [music] schedule, so it could</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.620" end="00:43:58.420" style="s2">change.</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.920" end="00:43:59.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. We&#39;re treating it as urgent now,</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.420" end="00:44:00.620" style="s2">not waiting two days. The alliance can</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.520" end="00:44:02.020" style="s2">provide the missing driver&#39;s vehicle</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.620" end="00:44:03.120" style="s2">records today. Use the direct contact,</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.020" end="00:44:04.220" style="s2">not the general transport office.</p>
<p begin="00:44:03.120" end="00:44:05.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lee and Jamie&#39;s sister need updated</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.220" end="00:44:06.020" style="s2">protection arrangements. [music] Their</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.120" end="00:44:06.620" style="s2">addresses shouldn&#39;t be passed through</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.020" end="00:44:07.720" style="s2">the employers.</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.620" end="00:44:09.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll contact them directly. Any new</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.720" end="00:44:11.220" style="s2">message goes to us unchanged. No one</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.320" end="00:44:12.420" style="s2">accepts a private meeting [music] offer.</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.220" end="00:44:14.020" style="s2">I keep going home with a new piece of</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.420" end="00:44:15.920" style="s2">paper. He keeps spending another night</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.020" end="00:44:17.220" style="s2">there. I wish I had an answer. Just</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.920" end="00:44:17.620" style="s2">stay. I can&#39;t take another promise</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.220" end="00:44:18.320" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.620" end="00:44:19.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They found the auction [music]</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.320" end="00:44:21.320" style="s2">intermediary. The serial number on the</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.920" end="00:44:22.120" style="s2">recovered caller matches an entry in his</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.320" end="00:44:23.620" style="s2">ledger.</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.120" end="00:44:25.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two men pulled them out down river. No</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.620" end="00:44:27.820" style="s2">ID. They wanted cash. I called Pike. Did</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.920" end="00:44:29.155" style="s2">he ask you to sell them? He could barely</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.820" end="00:44:31.520" style="s2">speak. I thought What did you hear</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.155" end="00:44:32.320" style="s2">[music] him say? A name, Finn. He kept</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.520" end="00:44:33.820" style="s2">asking for Finn.</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.320" end="00:44:35.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop it there. I wasn&#39;t an empty [music]</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.820" end="00:44:37.120" style="s2">crate. I was asking for help.</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.720" end="00:44:38.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The caller number matches the ledger.</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.120" end="00:44:40.920" style="s2">The payments match these dates. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.820" end="00:44:42.520" style="s2">what we can use.</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.920" end="00:44:45.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep your phone on. Nobody needs you</p>
<p begin="00:44:42.520" end="00:44:45.920" style="s2">standing outside a locked gate tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.020" end="00:44:48.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I kept thinking there was something I</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.020" end="00:44:49.820" style="s2">should have done on that boat. You</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.420" end="00:44:51.425" style="s2">called for Finn. You fought to stay</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.820" end="00:44:52.420" style="s2">alive. That&#39;s something. Come upstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.425" end="00:44:54.720" style="s2">[music] I&#39;ll keep the phone on the</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.420" end="00:44:54.720" style="s2">table.</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.121" end="00:44:59.821" style="s2">Not exactly a royal welcome.</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.321" end="00:45:01.906" style="s2">I like the burnt toast better than most</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.821" end="00:45:04.021" style="s2">state dinners. You burned it. You</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.906" end="00:45:06.221" style="s2">[music] ate it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.021" end="00:45:06.221" style="s2">Here.</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.921" end="00:45:09.721" style="s2">You don&#39;t have [music] to pretend you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.821" end="00:45:11.321" style="s2">not still angry. I&#39;m not very good at</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.721" end="00:45:12.521" style="s2">pretending around you. You took the</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.321" end="00:45:14.121" style="s2">evidence to the police. You stopped your</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.521" end="00:45:15.021" style="s2">own men. You came when I asked and left</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.121" end="00:45:16.121" style="s2">when I asked. [music] I noticed. I</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.021" end="00:45:17.821" style="s2">should have done all of it before you</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.121" end="00:45:19.121" style="s2">had to throw me out. Yes, you should</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.821" end="00:45:20.421" style="s2">have. I missed you in this room. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.121" end="00:45:21.556" style="s2">the part I haven&#39;t said. Can we have</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.421" end="00:45:22.621" style="s2">something that isn&#39;t a rescue? Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:45:21.556" end="00:45:24.021" style="s2">[music] I want to wait for you after</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.621" end="00:45:25.721" style="s2">class. Fight over where to get dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.021" end="00:45:27.721" style="s2">Here you call me Ronan and know you mean</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.721" end="00:45:29.121" style="s2">me. You have a council, a company,</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.721" end="00:45:30.521" style="s2">people who need you in another city.</p>
<p begin="00:45:29.121" end="00:45:31.421" style="s2">I&#39;ll still [music] have to go back, but</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.521" end="00:45:33.621" style="s2">you&#39;ll know when I&#39;m leaving and when</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.421" end="00:45:35.321" style="s2">I&#39;m coming home.</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.621" end="00:45:37.121" style="s2">If I&#39;m in danger, tell me. Don&#39;t keep me</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.321" end="00:45:38.421" style="s2">in the dark and call it protection.</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.121" end="00:45:39.821" style="s2">I will. [music] My school is mine to</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.421" end="00:45:41.121" style="s2">run. Your people don&#39;t report my</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.821" end="00:45:43.021" style="s2">movements to you because you&#39;re worried.</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.121" end="00:45:43.921" style="s2">Done. And if you need me to leave, say</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.021" end="00:45:46.021" style="s2">it. I&#39;ll do the same. No [music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.921" end="00:45:47.321" style="s2">disappearing. I still want you. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.021" end="00:45:48.721" style="s2">been angry that it didn&#39;t go away when I</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.321" end="00:45:50.521" style="s2">told you to leave. [music] You don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.721" end="00:45:52.021" style="s2">have to decide tonight. I can wait.</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.521" end="00:45:53.821" style="s2">Someone could see us. I know who I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.021" end="00:45:55.221" style="s2">standing with. Kiss me, Ronan. No more</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.821" end="00:45:57.221" style="s2">hiding.</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.221" end="00:45:58.521" style="s2">Stay tonight here with me [music] if</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.221" end="00:46:00.921" style="s2">that&#39;s what you want.</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.521" end="00:46:00.921" style="s2">It is.</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.021" end="00:46:04.121" style="s2">Still sore? When I turn too fast?</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.821" end="00:46:06.621" style="s2">[music] Then don&#39;t turn too fast. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.121" end="00:46:08.321" style="s2">not going anywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.621" end="00:46:10.221" style="s2">You keep fixing my collar. I keep</p>
<p begin="00:46:08.321" end="00:46:12.321" style="s2">finding reasons to touch you. You don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.221" end="00:46:13.321" style="s2">need one.</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.321" end="00:46:15.821" style="s2">You look like you&#39;re rehearsing a</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.321" end="00:46:17.321" style="s2">sentence. I have to go this morning. I</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.821" end="00:46:18.221" style="s2">want to come back tonight. When will you</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.321" end="00:46:19.621" style="s2">know?</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.221" end="00:46:22.621" style="s2">By 5:00. If it changes, [music] I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.621" end="00:46:23.821" style="s2">call before you start dinner. Good.</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.621" end="00:46:25.747" style="s2">I wasn&#39;t planning to cook for an empty</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.821" end="00:46:27.821" style="s2">chair. Then come home hungry and bring</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.747" end="00:46:29.221" style="s2">[music] takeout.</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.821" end="00:46:30.821" style="s2">Gareth&#39;s at the records office. He wants</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.221" end="00:46:33.521" style="s2">the original dispatch logs. The clerk</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.821" end="00:46:33.521" style="s2">won&#39;t hand them over.</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.321" end="00:46:38.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These are my department&#39;s [music]</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.421" end="00:46:39.421" style="s2">records. You barred me from the inquiry,</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.021" end="00:46:40.521" style="s2">not from my own job.</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.421" end="00:46:41.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re covered by the preservation</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.521" end="00:46:42.777" style="s2">notice. Nobody takes the originals out</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.921" end="00:46:42.921" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.777" end="00:46:44.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.921" end="00:46:45.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re letting outsiders decide what</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.121" end="00:46:46.621" style="s2">happens to me?</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.321" end="00:46:48.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m letting the evidence leave this room</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.621" end="00:46:50.421" style="s2">intact. Take [music] them in. Nobody</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.321" end="00:46:52.021" style="s2">touches those files.</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.421" end="00:46:54.521" style="s2">Gareth admits selling the route. The</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.021" end="00:46:55.521" style="s2">payments back that up.</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.521" end="00:46:56.821" style="s2">Who received it?</p>
<p begin="00:46:55.521" end="00:46:57.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The C building has the lower rooms and</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.821" end="00:46:58.523" style="s2">the high windows.</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.523" end="00:46:59.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The loading records connected to the</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.523" end="00:47:00.422" style="s2">North Gate pickups. The video alone</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.723" end="00:47:01.523" style="s2">couldn&#39;t tell us that.</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.422" end="00:47:02.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our observers have confirmed the van</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.523" end="00:47:04.122" style="s2">from the garage at that site. The entry</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.622" end="00:47:05.523" style="s2">and search are authorized. Medical teams</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.122" end="00:47:06.723" style="s2">are staged outside the inner perimeter.</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.523" end="00:47:07.922" style="s2">These plans are old. Expect doors that</p>
<p begin="00:47:06.723" end="00:47:09.323" style="s2">aren&#39;t marked. Check every room.</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.922" end="00:47:10.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nora and I can help identify the workers</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.323" end="00:47:12.622" style="s2">after you bring them out. I&#39;ll stay at</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.622" end="00:47:14.723" style="s2">the registration point.</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.622" end="00:47:18.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re moving the hostages. We go now.</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.723" end="00:47:18.622" style="s2">All teams, report your positions.</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.122" end="00:47:24.422" style="s2">You don&#39;t need your papers to come</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.223" end="00:47:27.122" style="s2">through. Let her check [music] your</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.422" end="00:47:27.122" style="s2">breathing first.</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.723" end="00:47:30.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He stayed down there. You heard that. He</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.723" end="00:47:30.622" style="s2">chose them.</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.592" end="00:47:31.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.622" end="00:47:33.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re getting out.</p>
<p begin="00:47:31.723" end="00:47:34.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s all you have to say?</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.122" end="00:47:35.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You wanted them trapped so you&#39;d have</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.323" end="00:47:36.622" style="s2">something to trade.</p>
<p begin="00:47:35.723" end="00:47:37.323" style="s2">Now you [music] have fewer people to</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.622" end="00:47:38.922" style="s2">threaten.</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.323" end="00:47:40.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silas, let him move away from you. We</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.922" end="00:47:43.023" style="s2">can hear you without a hostage.</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.523" end="00:47:44.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then listen while I move.</p>
<p begin="00:47:43.023" end="00:47:45.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help me get him upright.</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.823" end="00:47:48.223" style="s2">We don&#39;t need the main stairs.</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.922" end="00:47:49.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That door was locked every night.</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.223" end="00:47:50.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I watched them open it when they worked</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.223" end="00:47:51.823" style="s2">on the drain. There&#39;s a release on this</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.422" end="00:47:53.523" style="s2">side.</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.823" end="00:47:57.122" style="s2">The guard&#39;s gone now. We&#39;re in here.</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.523" end="00:47:57.122" style="s2">There are six of us. ONE CAN&#39;T WALK.</p>
<p begin="00:47:58.823" end="00:48:00.068" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jamie Cole?</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.523" end="00:48:00.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.068" end="00:48:00.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.122" end="00:48:02.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s Mr. Vane?</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.922" end="00:48:05.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Inside. The officers are helping him.</p>
<p begin="00:48:02.323" end="00:48:05.323" style="s2">Keep coming toward the lights.</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.618" end="00:48:09.922" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.323" end="00:48:11.122" style="s2">Side group clear. Six out. Jamie Cole is</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.922" end="00:48:11.922" style="s2">with us. We need medical at the side</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.122" end="00:48:12.922" style="s2">exit.</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.922" end="00:48:15.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t go back. They&#39;re all out from our</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.922" end="00:48:15.622" style="s2">room. I counted.</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.823" end="00:48:28.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me that.</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.422" end="00:48:30.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; West loading bay. Inside the safety</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.422" end="00:48:31.422" style="s2">wall. Silas has a gun.</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.122" end="00:48:32.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father can stop this. He signs the</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.422" end="00:48:34.023" style="s2">transfer of the operating [music]</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.223" end="00:48:35.122" style="s2">rights. He keeps his son. Simple. The</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.023" end="00:48:36.422" style="s2">police have your prisoners. My father&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.122" end="00:48:37.323" style="s2">signature won&#39;t make them disappear.</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.422" end="00:48:38.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think this port runs on your</p>
<p begin="00:48:37.323" end="00:48:39.723" style="s2">father&#39;s principles? I&#39;ve kept it moving</p>
<p begin="00:48:38.622" end="00:48:40.922" style="s2">while he polished his name. My father</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.723" end="00:48:42.122" style="s2">doesn&#39;t owe you your port, and</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.922" end="00:48:43.323" style="s2">trafficking people isn&#39;t a business you</p>
<p begin="00:48:42.122" end="00:48:45.223" style="s2">get to keep. Silas, release his [music]</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.323" end="00:48:47.323" style="s2">arm. Put the gun down. The exit isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.223" end="00:48:50.223" style="s2">opening for you.</p>
<p begin="00:48:47.323" end="00:48:50.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ronan, stay back.</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.122" end="00:48:55.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you hit? No. Look at me. Stay down</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.922" end="00:48:55.223" style="s2">with me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.723" end="00:48:58.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep your hand there until I take over.</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.053" end="00:48:58.523" style="s2">[music] Tell me his name and when he was</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.122" end="00:48:59.624" style="s2">hit.</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.523" end="00:49:01.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ronan Ash. Just</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.624" end="00:49:02.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; now. He also has a healing rib fracture</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.424" end="00:49:03.024" style="s2">on the left.</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.524" end="00:49:04.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elliot.</p>
<p begin="00:49:03.024" end="00:49:04.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here. You don&#39;t need to say anything</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.324" end="00:49:05.524" style="s2">clever.</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.624" end="00:49:06.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mike and Derek are detained at the</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.524" end="00:49:07.324" style="s2">vehicle exit. Medical transport lane is</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.924" end="00:49:08.224" style="s2">clear.</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.324" end="00:49:09.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The records [music] teams are securing</p>
<p begin="00:49:08.224" end="00:49:10.824" style="s2">the offices. I&#39;ll stay and identify our</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.524" end="00:49:12.124" style="s2">people. Go with him if the medics allow</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.824" end="00:49:13.624" style="s2">it. Nora&#39;s with you. I&#39;ll come back when</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.124" end="00:49:14.724" style="s2">I can.</p>
<p begin="00:49:13.624" end="00:49:16.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jamie?</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.724" end="00:49:18.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Out. [music] Alive.</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.824" end="00:49:18.924" style="s2">Julian&#39;s getting help for his arm.</p>
<p begin="00:49:18.124" end="00:49:20.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How soon can I travel?</p>
<p begin="00:49:18.924" end="00:49:21.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After we reassess you. Today your job is</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.224" end="00:49:21.924" style="s2">to rest and tell us when the pain</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.324" end="00:49:22.724" style="s2">changes.</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.924" end="00:49:23.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The delegates have the temporary</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.724" end="00:49:25.324" style="s2">authority you approved. They can manage</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.924" end="00:49:26.224" style="s2">a meeting without seeing your stitches.</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.324" end="00:49:27.424" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to say you&#39;re fine</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.224" end="00:49:29.149" style="s2">because I&#39;m looking at you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.424" end="00:49:29.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It hurts. Stay anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.149" end="00:49:31.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.724" end="00:49:32.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can do both.</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.424" end="00:49:34.424" style="s2">Jamie, open the door.</p>
<p begin="00:49:32.924" end="00:49:35.044" style="s2">Make sure people hear that part.</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.424" end="00:49:35.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will.</p>
<p begin="00:49:35.044" end="00:49:36.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:49:35.324" end="00:49:37.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He asked about your arm. Tell him the</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.424" end="00:49:38.724" style="s2">doctor expects a recovery. Tell him I</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.724" end="00:49:40.324" style="s2">complained about the food. He&#39;ll know</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.724" end="00:49:42.124" style="s2">I&#39;m not dying.</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.324" end="00:49:43.524" style="s2">Thank you for staying with them.</p>
<p begin="00:49:42.124" end="00:49:45.524" style="s2">I wasn&#39;t doing it to change your answer.</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.524" end="00:49:47.924" style="s2">I need you to know that.</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.524" end="00:49:47.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I believe you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:50.924" end="00:49:52.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to do that because I got</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.124" end="00:49:53.524" style="s2">hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.624" end="00:49:54.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.524" end="00:49:55.824" style="s2">I asked you to come back before any of</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.824" end="00:49:56.924" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.824" end="00:49:59.224" style="s2">When you&#39;re ready to leave the hospital,</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.924" end="00:50:00.024" style="s2">we can decide what that looks like.</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.224" end="00:50:02.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You kept [music] it.</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.024" end="00:50:02.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s my spare key.</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.324" end="00:50:08.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The case is moving forward. We have the</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.324" end="00:50:09.624" style="s2">money trail and transport records, too.</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.724" end="00:50:10.024" style="s2">It doesn&#39;t all depend on what you can</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.624" end="00:50:10.924" style="s2">remember.</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.024" end="00:50:12.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are they convicted [music] already?</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.924" end="00:50:13.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Proceedings take time. Some assets</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.424" end="00:50:14.324" style="s2">have been preserved under court orders.</p>
<p begin="00:50:13.324" end="00:50:14.724" style="s2">That isn&#39;t the same as compensation</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.324" end="00:50:15.724" style="s2">arriving tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.724" end="00:50:16.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; about the rent he missed while he was</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.724" end="00:50:17.024" style="s2">gone?</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.124" end="00:50:18.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can discuss immediate support</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.024" end="00:50:19.584" style="s2">separately. Receiving help doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.224" end="00:50:19.624" style="s2">require him to promise testimony today.</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.584" end="00:50:21.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.624" end="00:50:22.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to tell them what I saw. Just not</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.424" end="00:50:24.324" style="s2">in front of everyone at once.</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.524" end="00:50:26.134" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll ask for a private interview. With</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.324" end="00:50:27.324" style="s2">breaks? We&#39;ll go through what to expect</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.134" end="00:50:28.924" style="s2">[music] first.</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.324" end="00:50:30.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your seat&#39;s still yours. Come when</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.924" end="00:50:31.224" style="s2">you&#39;re ready.</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.024" end="00:50:33.524" style="s2">If you&#39;d rather try a different class,</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.224" end="00:50:34.724" style="s2">I&#39;ll help [music] you find one.</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.524" end="00:50:36.324" style="s2">Did you really know what I meant in the</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.724" end="00:50:38.924" style="s2">message? I knew you hadn&#39;t forgotten</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.324" end="00:50:40.724" style="s2">your own line.</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.924" end="00:50:43.024" style="s2">Keep a light [music] beside the door. If</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.724" end="00:50:45.524" style="s2">I call, come look for me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:43.024" end="00:50:45.524" style="s2">I heard you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.324" end="00:50:54.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want this seat?</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.524" end="00:50:54.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.224" end="00:50:58.124" style="s2">Tonight we&#39;re writing [music] about a</p>
<p begin="00:50:56.124" end="00:51:01.324" style="s2">place we choose to go.</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.124" end="00:51:01.324" style="s2">It doesn&#39;t have to be far away.</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.024" end="00:51:06.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re here as Elliot&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.525" end="00:51:06.825" style="s2">The review board can have the contracts</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.025" end="00:51:08.625" style="s2">tomorrow. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.825" end="00:51:10.925" style="s2">Tonight, sit down before the food goes</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.625" end="00:51:10.925" style="s2">cold.</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.625" end="00:51:15.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for inviting me.</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.525" end="00:51:15.915" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How will you manage the distance?</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.125" end="00:51:17.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve sorted the council schedule.</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.915" end="00:51:18.925" style="s2">[music] I&#39;ll travel when they need me.</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.325" end="00:51:20.625" style="s2">Elliot has a school here. One calendar,</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.925" end="00:51:21.725" style="s2">two very busy men. We&#39;ll manage. That</p>
<p begin="00:51:20.625" end="00:51:24.625" style="s2">sounds more useful than having Owen</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.725" end="00:51:24.625" style="s2">guard where everyone is.</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.025" end="00:51:29.425" style="s2">You know you don&#39;t have to [music] leave</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.925" end="00:51:30.325" style="s2">just because the answer hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.425" end="00:51:31.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.325" end="00:51:32.825" style="s2">I applied for this job because I want</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.625" end="00:51:34.910" style="s2">something that won&#39;t be measured by how</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.825" end="00:51:35.025" style="s2">close it keeps me to you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.910" end="00:51:37.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.025" end="00:51:37.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m glad you told me that.</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.025" end="00:51:39.225" style="s2">I&#39;ll call when I get there. You don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.925" end="00:51:41.525" style="s2">have to check on me. I&#39;ll wait for the</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.225" end="00:51:41.525" style="s2">call.</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.825" end="00:51:45.725" style="s2">You have a key?</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.725" end="00:51:47.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I [music] know.</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.725" end="00:51:48.525" style="s2">I just wanted to see you open the door.</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.525" end="00:51:49.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.525" end="00:51:50.925" style="s2">still want me? I brought more than a</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.925" end="00:51:52.425" style="s2">borrowed shirt this time. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.925" end="00:51:53.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. I cleared half the closet. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:51:52.425" end="00:51:55.225" style="s2">make me regret giving you that much</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.425" end="00:51:56.825" style="s2">space. Half? I was going to ask for one</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.225" end="00:51:59.325" style="s2">drawer.</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.825" end="00:52:00.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can negotiate down later. Come in.</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.325" end="00:52:01.825" style="s2">The whole name.</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.625" end="00:52:04.225" style="s2">You went to a lot of trouble keeping it</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.825" end="00:52:06.425" style="s2">from me. [music] I intend to use it.</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.225" end="00:52:07.925" style="s2">Did you bring dinner?</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.425" end="00:52:09.025" style="s2">I&#39;ll be away Tuesday night. Back</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.925" end="00:52:10.525" style="s2">Wednesday if the meeting finishes as</p>
<p begin="00:52:09.025" end="00:52:13.625" style="s2">scheduled. [music] I teach late on</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.525" end="00:52:13.625" style="s2">Wednesday. Let yourself in.</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.125" end="00:52:16.425" style="s2">There&#39;s no prize for waiting [music]</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.925" end="00:52:18.425" style="s2">downstairs in the cold. Not even</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.425" end="00:52:20.125" style="s2">breakfast. Breakfast is your job now.</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.425" end="00:52:21.525" style="s2">Try not to burn the toast.</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.125" end="00:52:22.825" style="s2">And no more secrets, [music] Ronan. Then</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.525" end="00:52:24.825" style="s2">here&#39;s the truth. I wanted to come home</p>
<p begin="00:52:22.825" end="00:52:27.925" style="s2">before the train even left.</p>
<p begin="00:52:24.825" end="00:52:27.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re here now. I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.276" end="00:52:31.296" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
